Matt,Kilts,Founding CEO/ Chairman,Trace Minerals,Founding CEO/ Chairman | Trace Minerals,"As the Founding CEO/Chairman of Trace Minerals , I have been leading the company's vision and strategy for over 26 years, with a focus on new business development, team building, and innovation. Trace Minerals is a pioneer and leader in the field of mineral-based supplements, providing quality products that support health and wellness for millions of customers worldwide. I have a passion for entrepreneurship and a strong track record of creating and growing successful businesses in the health and wellness industry. I have also partnered with other organizations and experts to advance the research and education on the benefits of trace minerals. My goal is to continue to expand the reach and impact of Trace Minerals , while staying true to our mission of remineralizing the world, improving the lives of our customers, employees, and communities.",No,,,,,,United States,Utah,Ogden,c_suite,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/matt-kilts-48aa3053,Trace Minerals,51-200,118,wellness and fitness services,,"Trace Minerals is the supplement brand you’ve know and trusted for over 50 years and is America's #1 selling trace mineral and liquid magnesium brand. 

At Trace Minerals, we’re here to help people everywhere remineralize their bodies—achieving and maintaining the ideal level of trace minerals that are just right for them—because we know the profound impact it can have on our ability to live better every single day.

You may think you’re getting the trace minerals you need through the foods you eat, the water you drink and the multivitamins you take. But the truth is, these vital minerals we need are no longer in our foods because of depleted soils, no longer in our water because of filtration and not always found in our multivitamins.

Trace minerals are essential to our growth, our development and our overall health, and we simply can’t perform at our best if we’re deficient in or have an imbalance of trace minerals. That’s why for more than 50 years, we’ve been dedicated to researching data, harvesting minerals and formulating best-in-class products that help you create a healthy daily foundation—a foundation that contains the right amount of essential trace minerals our bodies need for better play, better sleep, better care and better feeling each and every day.

