Although we have a 24-hour fitness center on site we are not just a gym. Most gyms and fitness centers fail their members 85% of the time, that’s why you see so many clubs offer discounted membership fees.  In other words, they are not very effective, people join, get discouraged, then don't return wasting precious time and money. Better yet, it discourages one to embark on any future attempts to improve their health.
 
