Monet,Gilliam,Chief Executive Officer,Compass Complex Discharge Solutions,Chief Executive Officer of Compass Complex Discharge Solutions,"Meet Monet Gilliam: From CNA to CEO
 
In the dynamic world of healthcare entrepreneurship, Monet Gilliam stands out as a beacon of inspiration and innovation. A young, trailblazing black woman entrepreneur, Monet's remarkable journey from Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) to CEO is a testament to her unwavering determination, unyielding passion, and steadfast faith.
 
A Humble Beginning
Monet Gilliam's journey into the healthcare industry began with the humblest of roles - that of a Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA). Her days were filled with rounds, making calls, and tirelessly advocating for patients within hospital Case Management departments. In these early years, Monet noticed a crucial need - the need for comprehensive and compassionate care solutions. It was this realization that ignited her entrepreneurial spirit.
 
Building Compass Complex Discharge Solutions
Determined to make a difference, Monet embarked on a courageous journey to create her own solution. With an unshakeable belief in her vision and an unrelenting work ethic, she founded Compass Complex Discharge Solutions (CCDS). Starting as a small, private at-home care company, Monet built CCDS from the ground up. Her dedication knew no bounds as she tirelessly learned every facet of the trade, from the intricacies of healthcare management to the nuances of entrepreneurship.
 
A Remarkable Transformation
Under Monet's visionary leadership, CCDS underwent a remarkable transformation. What once began as a modest endeavor evolved into a thriving, dynamic healthcare enterprise. Today, CCDS is a recognized leader in the industry, providing cutting-edge, streamlined care solutions that have a profound impact on patients' lives.
 
A Heart Full of Gratitude
Despite her monumental achievements, Monet Gilliam remains grounded and humble. She attributes her success to a higher power and openly gives thanks to God for gifting her with the care, passion, and unwavering determination to make CCDS what it is today. Her faith not only fuels her own journey but also serves as an inspiration to those around her.
 
A Vision for the Future
As CEO of Compass Complex Discharge Solutions, Monet Gilliam continues to lead with vision and compassion. Her journey from CNA to CEO is a testament to the power of determination, passion, and unwavering faith. Monet's story is an inspiration to aspiring entrepreneurs, especially women and people of color, proving that with dedication and belief in one's mission, anything is possible.",No,,,,,,United States,Florida,Maitland,c_suite,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/monet-gilliam,Compass Complex Discharge Solutions,11-50,8,individual and family services,,"A Care Team Whose Innovative Approach is Bridging the Gap Between Complex Discharges & Compassionate Care Management.

At Compass Complex Discharge Solutions, we hold a firm belief that keeping an open mind is the cornerstone of finding effective solutions. As a healthcare solutions provider, we utilize evidence-backed strategies to tackle complex discharges and related obstacles. Our aim is to offer comprehensive solutions that cover all your needs.

Our team includes attorneys, care managers, professional guardians, Medicaid specialists, and nursing professionals who are experts in handling intricate cases. We strive to simplify the healthcare system by serving as a single point of contact. With just one phone call and one referral, we focus on one paramount goal: to safely discharge complex patients with minimal expenses.

We’re prepared to collaborate with your team and contribute to individual cases, freeing up your team’s time and resources for other aspects of the patient’s comprehensive care plan. We aim to complement your team, employing patient-centered planning processes geared towards finding the optimal solution for each patient’s complex discharge. Our reputation and relationships with local health professionals are crucial elements of our care delivery model. Our exceptional partnerships involve active collaboration with healthcare facilities such as skilled nursing homes, assisted living and residential care homes, Traumatic Brain Injury (TBI) centers, and home health agencies.",http://www.compasscds.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/compasscds,SELF_OWNED,0,100000-500000,,,compasscds.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
