Throughout my career, I have worked across the full spectrum of orthobiologics while maintaining strict adherence to FDA guidance and professional standards. I have developed protocols built around reliable, reproducible, and cost-effective treatments. My approach combines advanced A2M and PRP procedures with adjunct therapies, such as radial and focused shockwave therapy and ultra-weak magnetic field therapy, to optimize healing potential.

I also focus on pelvic floor stabilization and strengthening to support pelvic floor, hip, and spine health. Core stability and biomechanical control play a critical role in both injury prevention and long-term musculoskeletal performance.

