up Therapy (Codependency &amp; Boundaries)Corporate Workshops (Psychological safety &amp; inclusive leadership)You don't have to choose between your mental health and your ambition. If you’re struggling with work anxiety, ""first-gen"" guilt, or ADHD overwhelm, you’re in the right place. Let’s Talk Psychological Wellness provides the tools that high-performing professionals and college and graduate students need to stay grounded.Whether you need an early morning session before work or a weekend slot, we have the space for you.👉 Book a FREE 15-minute consultation. (Or feel free to DM me—no pressure.)",Yes,,,,,,United States,New York,New York,founder,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/nathileecaldeiraphd,"Let's Talk Psychological Wellness, P.C.",11-50,24,mental health care,,"On the outside, you’re managing it all. On the inside, you’re holding your breath.

