Luis,Belen,Chief Executive Officer,NHIT,Chief Executive Officer at National Health IT Collaborative for the Underserved,"Luis Belén is a nationally recognized leader in health policy and innovation, dedicated to achieving healthcare transformation through technology, policy, and leadership. As CEO of the National Health IT Collaborative for the Underserved (NHIT®), he is a key collaborator with the White House, Capitol Hill, and strategic partners, driving the advancement of AI-powered healthcare solutions and mentoring the next generation of health leaders.

