Lisa Marie,"Bobby, PhD, LP, LMFT, BCC","Host of Love, Happiness, and Success For Therapists",Growing Self Counseling & Coaching,"Love, Happiness, & Success For Therapists Podcast Host, Psychologist, LMFT, AAMFT Clinical Supervisor, Board Certified Coach, Founder/CEO at Growing Self Counseling & Coaching, Therapist Educator, Author of Exaholics","Here's what I know after 20 years in this field: therapists are extraordinary people doing extraordinarily hard work — often in isolation, often without adequate support, and almost always at some cost to themselves. I'm Dr. Lisa Marie Bobby — licensed psychologist, LMFT, board-certified coach, and founder of Growing Self. I built my practice around one goal: to take care of the therapists doing this work. What grew from that is a community, an education platform, a podcast network, and a wraparound support system for clinicians who deserve the same level of care they provide to others. Here's how I can support you: The Love, Happiness &amp; Success For Therapists Podcast is for the helper who needs help too. Tune in for practical wisdom from professionals who understand what this work demands, thought leadership from the voices shaping our field, and the reminder that the most giving person in the room deserves to grow too. Join the conversation → https://drlisamariebobby.com/ The Therapist Growth Collective is your soft place to land. Community, connection, consultation, and continuing education — built for solo practitioners operating in isolation. The benefits of a group practice, without the sacrifice or expense. Learn more → https://lovehappinesssuccess.org/4pHEHlw And for therapists ready for something bigger — I'm here to help you break free from the medical model entirely. The clients in your office today often don't need clinical treatment. They need a skilled guide for the growth work ahead: navigating divorce, reinventing a career, preparing for marriage, redesigning a life. Insurance won't cover it. The DSM can't code it. And without a clear framework, you've been improvising. Coaching psychology is that framework — and it's not what you think. Therapists don't learn that it's a real discipline: with peer-reviewed research, graduate-level curricula, established frameworks, and evidence-based systems of motivation and change. It gives you what clinical training didn't: a clear, systematic methodology for facilitating development and outcomes in people who have no need of treatment. Therapists are the most qualified to do this work, and the coaching space needs us to set the standard. Your practice and your clients can flourish, but you need trustworthy, therapist-specific education and credentialing to navigate this space.  Find it here → https://lovehappinesssuccess.org/coach-training-programThanks for stopping by to learn about me. I'd like to learn about you too — connect with me!xo, LIsa",Yes,,,,,,United States,Colorado,Denver Metropolitan Area,founder,"master_human_resources, education, consulting",https://www.linkedin.com/in/drlisabobby,Growing Self Counseling & Coaching,11-50,29,mental health care,,"Welcome to Growing Self Counseling and Coaching, a positive and mission-driven group private practice that cultivates wellbeing, growth, and success for both therapists and clients. Established in Denver, Colorado in 2005, we've expanded to several offices throughout the state and offer online services across the US and internationally.

As a clinician, you'll find ample opportunities to specialize in couples counseling, growth-oriented therapy, life coaching, career counseling, and professional development coaching. Our collective of dedicated professionals teaches others to create love, happiness, and success through personal and professional growth, empowering them to build healthy relationships and authentic wellbeing for generations to come.

Our core values—growth, love, happiness, and success—are at the heart of everything we do, and we're committed to supporting our clinicians every step of the way. We celebrate diversity, equity, and inclusion, and provide trustworthy clinical supervision and consultation. We emphasize professional growth, continuing education, and self-of-therapist development within a nurturing community that supports work/life balance and emotional wellbeing.

At Growing Self, we provide a supportive environment for clinicians seeking the freedom and flexibility of private practice. Our services include a reliable stream of referrals, customizable work weeks, responsive administrative & billing support, and effective marketing. We also offer weekly team trainings, community events, personal and professional support, case consultations, success coaching, and help with licensure.

