Will,Clower,CEO,Mediterranean Wellness,"CEO, Mediterranean Wellness — Building AI-powered population health technology | Neuroscience PhD | Award-Winning Author","I founded Mediterranean Wellness in 2003 after earning my neuroscience PhD at Emory and conducting neuroscience research at the Institut des Sciences Cognitives in Lyon, France. Living in the Mediterranean showed me how an entire culture's approach to food, movement, and stress produces dramatically better health outcomes — and I've spent two decades building the technology to deliver those outcomes at population scale. Today, MedWell serves over 150 clients covering over 300,000 lives, delivering 175+ personalized programs across nutrition, activity, mindfulness, and weight management. Our MedGuard platform integrates predictive analytics, behavioral and claims data, and disease management nursing to create individually tailored interventions — measurable against both health outcomes and employer cost curves. What I'm building now: an AI-powered engagement layer that brings conversational health coaching into the platform, informed by clinical data and designed to learn and improve with every interaction. The goal is a closed-loop system where intervention, measurement, and optimization happen continuously — not annually. My background in behavioral neuroscience isn't incidental to this work — it's foundational. Understanding how people actually change behavior is the difference between wellness programs that get completed and wellness programs that collect dust. I'm an award-winning author of 4 books, dozens of articles -- in primary neuroscience research, scholarly research into the history of neuroscience as well as assessment of the philosophical models of paradigm shifts in science in general. Faculty, Victoria University of Wellington. Wellness Ambassador, New Zealand.",Yes,,,,,,United States,Florida,Miami,c_suite,"c_suite, medical_health",https://www.linkedin.com/in/willclower,Mediterranean Wellnes