Lori,McNeill,Director Board of Directors,Sonnet BioTherapeutics,"CEO & Founder, Chairman of the Board, Keynote Speaker, Women's Leadership Champion, Change Management Thought Leader","Lori is the Founder and CEO of McNeill Consulting. The company serves the needs to biotech companies in regards to commercialization and Go-to-market strategy and messaging. McNeill Consulting also services startups and Fortune 500 Companies with regards to strategy, marketing, operations, change management, and leadership development. 

