Physiotrace Smart is a prescription product and can be prescribed by any physician or medical practitioner for adults with cardiac risk or those who are eligible for cardiac rehabilitation after a procedure or diagnosis. 

Do you have any conditions such as Hypertension, High cholesterol, Diabetes or Thyroid imbalance?

Do you have any genetic risks or have high stress lifestyle, or do you smoke?

Do you want to achieve your best exercise performance without risking your heart health?

If your answer is a YES to at least one of the above questions, you may be at risk of cardiac event or may need clinical guidance for safe and effective exercise.  Good news is, knowing the risk before you are symptomatic can provide you actionable insights into your heart health and most importantly help avoid a heart attack.
NimbleHeart's FDA approved wearable Physiotrace technology was initially developed for NASA Space Flight monitoring. It is also being used to monitor Cardiac Rehabilitation patients across the country and for preventive screening of First Responder staff.

NimbleHeart is now pleased to offer preventive cardiac screening program based on exercise ECG using Physiotrace Smart to the individuals with the above risk factors. During exercise, the heart is under stress and the exercise ECG can indicate early signs of Cardiac Events. This can help you change your lifestyle adequately with the recommended exercise and receive timely preventive treatment such as medication or a proactive surgery, if necessary, to avoid any serious damage to the heart through a cardiac event.",https://www.nimbleheart.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/nimbleheart,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,100000-500000,3237507,UNDISCLOSED,nimbleheart.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
