Jay,Michaels,Co-Founder & Head of Breeding and Applied Genomics,NorCal Seeds & Genetics,Co-Founder & Head of Breeding & Applied Genomics | NorCal Seeds & Genetics,"Plant geneticist and breeder with more than four decades of experience working at the intersection of cannabis breeding, applied plant science, and long-term genetic stewardship. Jay Michaels’ work is rooted in the careful observation, development, and preservation of cannabis genetics across multiple eras of cultivation and research.

As Co-Founder and Head of Breeding & Applied Genomics at NorCal Seeds & Genetics, Jay designs and leads breeding programs focused on cultivar stabilization, phenotypic performance, and genetic integrity. His work spans germplasm development, lineage tracking, seed and pollen banking, and the integration of field-validated breeding outcomes with applied genomic tools.

Jay’s expertise is grounded in long-running research and production environments that functioned as real-world testbeds for genetic performance, adaptability, and resilience. These environments provided the empirical foundation for breeding systems and methodologies that continue to inform NorCal Seeds & Genetics’ research strategy and the genetic assets stewarded under NSG Holdings, Inc.

In parallel with his work at NSG, Jay is periodically retained as an independent cannabis genetics and cultivation expert, providing advisory support and expert consultation related to breeding programs, genetic integrity, and biological risk assessment. His conclusions are based on longitudinal data, documented field observation, and scientifically defensible methods developed over decades of practice.

Jay’s focus today is ensuring that legacy and novel cannabis genetics are responsibly preserved, understood, and advanced supporting a future where genetic knowledge is treated as an asset requiring care, continuity, and respect.",No,,,,,,United States,California,Santa Rosa,founder,master_engineering_technical,https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaywmichaels,NorCal Seeds & Genetics,2-10,5,biotechnology research,,"NorCal Seeds & Genetics (NSG) is a legacy cannabis genetics company dedicated to the long-term stewardship, preservation, and continuity of cannabis cultivars.

With over fifty years of combined expertise and a history rooted in early breeding innovation, NSG’s work prioritizes genetic integrity, controlled reproduction, and documentation through time. Rather than drive short-term commercialization, NSG has focused on maintaining viability and continuity of foundational genetics, rebuilding breeding infrastructure, and positioning its library for scientific rigor and verification.

This page shares perspective, reflections, and insights on genetic stewardship and the evolving value of cannabis genetics as a biological resource.
It is a record of long-view thinking, not product advertising.

Whether you are a researcher, genetic steward, or industry observer, NSG’s approach reveals how long-term discipline and continuity create durable, credible value.",http://www.norcalseedsandgenetics.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/norcal-seeds-and-genetics,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,100000-500000,,,norcalseedsandgenetics.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
