Ross,Youngs,CEO & Founder,"Biosortia, Inc.","CEO & Founder @ Biosortia, Inc. |  microbiome data & training for direct novel molecule & AI drug discoveries -- de-risking (polypharmacology (multi-target) and single-target).","Providing previously unobtainable drug-like small molecules (IP) directly from microbiomes to partners discovering new therapeutics, agrochemicals, longevity, & more w/ complete AI datasets

Biosortia has perfected a technological breakthrough (equity funding >$11 million, non-dilute funding of >$9 million -ARPA-E, DARPA, USAF-RL, NIH) & is ready to go to scale.  multiple peer-reviewed papers were published, and one received recognition from the American Chemical Society ('Editors Choice Award').  

Researchers in & out of pharma understand the dynamic of getting to the hidden chemistry of life & the valuable contributions to new products & scientific advancement.

Mining accessible microbiomes at an industrial scale, in quality, and quantity, is real and legitimately the only way to uncover the critically important small molecule secrets of microbes and microbiomes that is leverageable to all therapeutics and life sciences.

Scale matters and microbiome harvesting have been proof of concept tested at six orders of magnitude over existing technologies and have found a wealth of novel small molecules. In time, potentially eight orders of magnitude improvement will occur - economically.

Take any other technology and try to move it even one order of magnitude improvement, which will likely cost billions. For example, try to advance any analytical chemistry instrumentation improvement by one order of magnitude.

It is time for life science thought leaders, influencers, and strategists to understand and accurately name the problem in life science discovery. This is a linear scale issue - either improve working with less (instrumentation and technology) or start working with more. Very two-dimensional.

Persistence and determination will prevail in the end & ultimately, major breakthroughs will result and benefit humanity.

National Business Person of the Year 1998 SBA, Five Time Inc 500 CEO, Hall of Fame INC. Magazine, Ernst & Young Entrepreneur of Year Ohio, Serial inventor & Entrepreneur, > 75 international patents issued.  Thought Leader, leadership, influencer

