Shebani,Sethi MD ABOM,Founder & CEO,"Metabolic Psychiatry Labs, Inc.","Advancing Mental Health Through Metabolic Science | Stanford Physician-Scientist & Clinical Associate Professor | Founder, Metabolic Psychiatry Labs | Mom","Dr. Shebani Sethi is a Stanford physician-scientist working at the intersection of psychiatry and metabolic medicine to better understand and treat mental illness. Board-certified in both psychiatry and obesity medicine, she brings an integrated approach to addressing the biological connections between metabolic dysfunction and psychiatric conditions. In 2015, Dr. Sethi coined the term ""Metabolic Psychiatry"" and founded the first academic clinical and research program at Stanford dedicated to this field. Her NIH and foundation-funded research investigates how metabolic interventions, including ketogenic and low-carbohydrate therapies, affect patients with bipolar disorder, schizophrenia, and treatment-resistant depression. In 2024, she founded Metabolic Psychiatry Labs to translate this research into practical tools that help a broader range of patients and clinicians integrate metabolic care into psychiatric treatment. Her work has been featured in The New York Times, NPR, Forbes, Good Morning America, and Stanford Medicine. Principal Investigator: Clinical trials on metabolic medications and ketogenic therapeutic interventions for mental illness.Associations: Northern California Psychiatric Society, Obesity Medicine Association, World Obesity Federation, American Psychiatric Association, and American College of Physician ExecutivesFocus: Metabolic therapies for psychiatric disorders · Clinical biomarkers · Scalable care delivery",Yes,,,,,,United States,,San Francisco Bay Area,founder,"c_suite, medical_health",https://www.linkedin.com/in/drsethi,"Metabolic Psychiatry Labs, Inc.",2-10,13,mental health care,,"Metabolic Psychiatry Labs (MPL) is a clinical research and innovation lab delivering care through remote care technology by pioneering a new approach to mental health  targeting  metabolic roots.
Founded by Stanford’s flagship metabolic psychiatry physician scientist, Dr. Shebani Sethi, MPL is advancing the field of Metabolic Psychiatry through translational science, clinical trials, and the development of tools that empower both patients and providers through a digital health platform.
Our core areas of focus include ketogenic dietary therapies, metabolic biomarker discovery, and digital interventions for conditions like depression, bipolar disorder,  treatment-resistant psychosis, and obesity.
