Anson,Flake,Co-founder & Director,Aurelius Brain Health & Human Performance,"Co-Founder, Aurelius Brain Health & Human Performance | Angel Investor | Board Member | Entrepreneur","My path to Aurelius and HydroWorx was personal.HydroWorx began after a knee injury led me to rehabilitate in Dr. Hetrick’s early hydrotherapy prototype — and eventually we built the company together. We grew from one clinic to serve 90%+~ of the teams in NFL, NBA, MLB, Premier League and 100% of the power 5 Universities.  Olympic medalists, U.S. Special Forces units, and leading hospitals and rehabilitation centers worldwide are customers.  I was a co-inventor on two issued utility patents from that work. HydroWorx was later acquired by private equity.Aurelius emerged later following my experience with a neurological infection, Meningitis (3x) and chronic neuroinflammation that was ultimately solved by Judith Miklossy,MD, PhD, DSc : https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15665404/.  Her research and advice reshaped my understanding of brain health and mental health challenges and she led me to pursue a holistic approach combining daily exercise, 80 hours of hyperbaric oxygen therapy (HBOT), healthy nutrition, and daily meditation.  This holistic combination resulted in full recovery and I was able to taper off six brain medications.  At Aurelius Brain Health &amp; Human Performance, I lead a small team that developed the Aurelius Clinic and Protocol  — a proprietary and holistic daily stack of HBOT, Transcranial Magnetic Stimulation (TMS) and strength training and exercise.  We are focused on cognitive performance and accelerating recovery from PTSD, traumatic brain injury (TBI), depression, and anxiety. The protocol has been utilized with U.S. Special Operations and Veterans across 20+ states and multiple countries, with consistently strong outcomes. Patent filings cover therapeutic processes and delivery platforms. https://myaurelius.org/Angel Investor in startups and early-stage companies, primarily across mental health and rehabilitation, as well as select investments that back remarkable founders. I tend to work closely with founders around product-market fit, marketing clarity, and bootstrapped growth strategies.Board member of a publicly traded financial institution, with experience in audit, governance, and risk oversight. Licensed attorney (Pennsylvania, retired status).",No,,,,,,United States,Pennsylvania,Greater Harrisburg Area,founder,"c_suite, master_human_resources, medical_health",https://www.linkedin.com/in/anson-flake-25709a20,Aurelius Brain Health & Human Performance,2-10,5,wellness and fitness services,,"We are a non-profit clinic on a mission to accelerate the healing process for chronic Traumatic Brain Injuries (TBIs), Post Traumatic Stress (PTS), Depression and Anxiety. 

To accomplish our mission, we combine three holistic modalities:
- Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy (HBOT)
- Transcranial Magnetic Stimulation (TMS)
- Performance Training

Our Programs are:
- Cost-free
- Confidential
