Mohammed,Abouelsoud,Chief Executive Officer,U: The Mind Company,"CEO @ U: The Mind Company | Computational Neuroscientist | Building Brain Stimulation Technology That Treats Parkinson’s, Alzheimer’s, and Optimizes Cognition","The brain is not just where disease lives. It's where performance is built. I study both.At 19, I was diagnosed with bipolar disorder. Suicidal ideation followed me into my early 20s. Medication didn't work. Not really. I kept searching for something that could actually change what was happening inside my brain, not just manage it from the outside. That search became a companyI founded U: The Mind Company in October 2018. But the second founding moment happened in May 2019, when I started using the device myself. That month changed everything. My clarity, my stability, my ability to show up. The science I was building for patients was rebuilding me at the same time. I'm a neuroscientist, founder, and longevity practitioner working at the intersection of brain research, human performance, and precision medicine. Most people treat health optimization and clinical medicine as separate conversations. I've spent eight years proving they're the same conversation. 🔬 THE SCIENCEU: The Mind Company brings precision neurostimulation out of hospital rooms and into people's homes. What started as a mission for Psychiatric, Parkinson's, and Alzheimer's patients revealed something bigger. The same brain pathways we target for disease are the ones that govern focus, resilience, decision-making, and longevity in healthy people too. 🧠 CLINICAL RESULTS → Up to 64% symptom improvement in Parkinson's patients → Up to 77% tremor-band power reduction → 580% hippocampal activation in Alzheimer's patients → Zero serious adverse events across 250+ patients treated → FDA De Novo pathway in progress 🌱 HOW I THINK ABOUT HEALTH Longevity is not a supplement stack. Biohacking is not a trend. They are the serious pursuit of understanding how the human body and brain age, adapt, and perform. I study sleep, stress physiology, metabolic health, movement, and neurostimulation as a unified system. The goal is not just a longer life. It is a sharper, fuller one. 🤝 LET'S CONNECT → Investors in digital therapeutics, longevity, and brain health → Hospitals and clinical research partners → Wellness brands and health optimization platforms → Podcasts, speakers bureaus, and media 🌐 uthemind.company Your mind is infinite. We're here to prove it.",No,,,,,,United States,Ohio,Greater Cleveland,c_suite,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohammed-abouelsoud-6876a6126,U: The Mind Company,11-50,33,medical equipment manufacturing,,"We develop Precision Noninvasive Neuromodulation devices for Parkinson’s Disease and other neurological disorders. This is part of our Compressive Healthcare Intelligence Platform (CHIP) that we deploy into hospitals and clinics worldwide.

