Manami,"Yamamoto, LMFT/ Psychotherapist",Founder/President,Blue Humming Therapy,"Global Mental Health Leader | Psychotherapist | Founder & CEO of Nonprofits, Blue Humming Therapy (US) and MHEC (US–Japan hybrid) | Expressive Arts Therapist ☘️Promoting “Inner Nurturing” for True Mental Wellness.","""Truly Be Well, Inner Nurturing, From Fixing to Nurturing""
True wellness is not something we chase. It already lives within us.

As a psychotherapist and Global Mental Health Advocate, I am dedicated to advancing a new era of true wellness, one that moves beyond the idea of fixing what is broken and instead nurtures what is already alive within us.

I believe we each carry inner resources, strength, and resilience, even when we feel overwhelmed, disconnected, or discouraged. Mental health support becomes most powerful and sustainable when it helps people recognize their internal wellness and learn how to nurture it with compassion, presence, and practical care. This kind of support should never be a privilege. It should be accessible to everyone, equally, no matter who you are or where you live.

Through collaboration with diverse clients and communities worldwide, I work to innovate and strengthen support systems that honor each person’s holistic needs and lived experience. My mission is to make mental health and wellness resources truly inclusive and create care that meets people where they are.

I am committed to creating environments that support both mental and physical well-being, spaces where individuals and communities feel empowered to thrive, cultivate hope and joy, and build pride in the journey of truly being well.

My vision is a world where wellness is not something we earn or chase, but a universal right, nurtured from within and supported across all boundaries.


