◆Marquis Who’s Who in America | Listee (2025): Inducted into the prestigious biographical registry of noteworthy American professionals.

◆Fluxx Awards (2025) | Double Honoree: Recipient of the Mental Health Global Pioneer Award of “Innovation Across Borders” and “Community Centered Wellness Leader.”

◆Global Woman of the Year | Top 100 Finalist (2025): Recognized among the world’s impactful female leaders.

◆The Book of Legacy ""101 Great People Who Made The Good News"" (2025): Selected as one of 101 global figures celebrated for making a positive historical impact.

◆Brainz 500 Global Award (2021): Named to the list of 500 influential leaders globally.

