Sang H.,L.,Chief Executive Officer & Founder,EIGEN Bio,"AI x Bio | Building frontier AI to unlock biological causality | Passions are science, health and blockchain","Sang Lee builds frontier AI systems that decode human biology. As an entrepreneur at the intersection of artificial intelligence, biotechnology, and digital infrastructure, he works on transforming raw molecular signals—especially RNA—into predictive, actionable models for health, disease, and precision medicine at population scale. His ventures also extend into advanced capital-markets engineering, where he develops AI-driven financial systems and new architectures for digital asset infrastructure.

