How many of us have had aging family and friends who were in and out of the hospital, treating chronic conditions, many times per year. But each time, they leave the hospital in worse condition than they entered. My mother suffered more than she needed to at the end of her life. Let’s change this!

Care coordination has long been cited as one of the most glaring gaps in our healthcare system. Medical errors (which includes coordination of care) are the third leading cause of death in the US!

Care coordination communication must be clear, timely, relevant, accountable and secure. In addition, proper authorization is also required to engage and share data across each patient’s “Community of Care” including family members, physicians, nurses, and specialists. Communications and accountability often break down and negatively impact outcomes.

The MISSION:

* We must make it easier for healthcare providers to get paid for care they are already performing as a matter of good practice.
* Clinical documentation must be available to all providers across the Spectrum of a person's care and the documentation must be clean, compliant and aligned with CMS policy.
* Case Management clinical call center services companies need an integrated platform to streamline their operations for Virtual Care and generate a new revenue stream for their provider-customers.
* Medical IoT device companies need an integrated platform so their healthcare provider customers can collect the clinical documentation required to provide preventative services and bill for their encounters.",Yes,,,,,,United States,New Jersey,Flemington,founder,"master_information_technology, medical_health",https://www.linkedin.com/in/pjstevenson,Freedom Healthcare,2-10,55,hospitals and health care,,"Freedom Healthcare was formed as a Private Ministerial Association, a 508(c)(1)(a) non-profit. Our founding principles, vision and mission are God-lead and directed by His Word.  We have chosen our “Ministry” to be healthcare, with the goal of providing affordable healthcare to the public, based on freedom of choice, practitioners and options for healthcare, outside of the current “health systems”. Healthcare that is nature based and focused on our perfect God-given immune system. We strive to promote health through a body-mind-spirit approach.",http://www.freedom-healthcare.us,https://www.linkedin.com/company/freedom-healthcare-us,NON_PROFIT,0,1000000-5000000,,,freedom-healthcare.us,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
