J Michael,Gold,President & CEO,Age In Place Home Care,President & CEO at Age in Place Home Care Franchising Systems,"Plymouth Meeting, PA – Age in Place Home Care, one of Pennsylvania’s premier non-medical home care agencies is proud to announce that it will begin to strategically offer franchise opportunities throughout Pennsylvania and Northeastern United States.  The ever evolving healthcare landscape, aided by an aging population is accelerating the use of local home care agencies like Age in Place Home Care as a reliable, alternative to nursing homes or other types of assisted living institutions.

“We’ve built a very successful model in southeastern Pennsylvania and we’re excited to bring this success to additional Pennsylvania markets as well as surrounding areas,” says President & CEO, J. Michael Gold.  “We’ve worked very hard to develop strategic relationships that our franchisees will be able to access and have developed an operating model that is simple to replicate. Finding the right partners throughout our geography will be key to launching Age in Place Home Care’s services in other geographic locations”.   

