Jessica,Kane,Co-Owner & Chief Marketing Officer,BodyBio,Co-Owner & CMO at BodyBio | Mom of 3 | Scaling a third generation wellness brand started by my grandfather | Proving that health optimization starts at the cellular level,"I grew up watching my grandfather mix his own supplements in his bathtub.

