Dr. Seth,Hickerson,CEO & Founder,My Steady Mind,My Steady Mind Founder - Author - Keynote Speaker -  Neuroplasticity Expert - Veteran - Risk Mitigator,"I help people and teams not make shitty decisions under pressure. 

The 2 things that cause the most chaos for people working in high risk organizations is an 8 second attention span and the inability to pause when pissed, to slow down and actually think before responding.  

I have seen this demonstrated in every industry that I have worked it and it manifests itself in painful ways that can bring people and industries to their knees.

It’s psychological warfare out there and most people are completely unarmed.

Whether it’s in the field of law enforcement where one wrong decision can be life, death or lawsuits. Or a department having difficulty recruiting and retaining talent due to low morale and public perception. Officers are working in an industry that they love, that hasn’t loved them back.

Construction industry where safety and risk mitigation is paramount.  The root cause of most incidents and accidents is distracted and frustrated workers not a lack of SOPs or PPE.

Sales teams that can’t hit goals due to subconscious self-sabotaging behavior, ego’s and poor communication. 

Corporate America not understanding that their people are their #1 asset and their people’s #1 asset is their mind.  Burnout, toxic work environments, unrealistic expectations and lack of clarity and vision are stifling productivity. 

Individuals wanting to grow and develop themselves into their best versions but are feeling stuck, consumed with negative self-talk, low self-esteem, imposter syndrome, stuck in and uncomfortable “comfort zone"".

The relentless demands on our time and attention at home and work are keeping us exhausted, stressed, anxious and irritated. 

We need to learn how to break free from it, individually and organizationally, to learn how to reduce organizational stress to unlock our true capabilities and capacities.  To SLOW DOWN and learn how to implement the RIGHT kind of training. 

The good news is that we have the most science based and proven training solutions to resolve these issues. It's not ""wellness"" ""safety"" or ""mental health"" training. 

Its Elite Mental Fitness Training that people need/want.  They just have never had access to it. Until now.

Me and the My Steady Mind Team provide you with all the tools, techniques and tactics to become unfuckwithable.  

Level up and operate at your best...and control your future.  

