Elsa,"Jungman, Ph.D.",Founder & CEO,HelloBiome,Founder & CEO @HelloBiome | Advancing Consumer Health with Microbiome Intelligence | Editor | Advisor,"Dr. Elsa Jungman is a French-American entrepreneur and scientist driving innovation in skin health through microbiome research. She holds a Ph.D. in skin barrier function and has worked with leading companies including L’Oréal, K18, and AOBiome. Her research on the skin microbiome led her to identify its transformative potential for the consumer health and beauty industry. In 2020, she launched a pioneering microbiome-friendly skincare line, followed by a direct-to-consumer microbiome test kit distributed through retailers such as Credo Beauty and FaceHaus. In 2022, she founded HelloBiome, a microbiome intelligence platform that leverages clinical data and AI to enable product innovation, clinical research, and personalized consumer solutions. Through HelloBiome, she is advancing how microbiome data is translated into actionable insights and scalable applications.

