Did you know that ineffective drug disposal not only threatens the environment—polluting water supplies and ecosystems—but also increases the risk of drug diversion and misuse? This undermines the very purpose of safe disposal, contributing to addiction and putting communities at risk. Carbon drug disposal products cannot destroy drugs, perpetuating the risk to both water supplies and people. 

