Jesse,Hercules,Chief Executive Officer,TheraVista Health,TheraVista CEO,"I'm a health technology startup CEO.  Currently leading the team at TheraVista Health, where we are changing the game in vestibular physical therapy with an App that uses AI vision to help patients do their home exercises correctly.  

