able, sustainable results. I help boards think forward; integrating governance, financial oversight, and emerging technologies like AI to strengthen performance and long-term resilience.  Currently seeking corporate board opportunities (public and private) where I can contribute to strategy, governance, risk oversight, and innovation.",No,,,,,,United States,West Virginia,Charleston,c_suite,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/sonyahairston,YWCA Charleston WV,51-200,49,individual and family services,,"Since 1912, YWCA Charleston has stood as a pillar of strength, safety, and support in the Kanawha Valley—helping women, children, and families reclaim stability, dignity, and purpose. Founded as a safe haven for young women from rural communities pursuing work in Charleston, our organization has grown into the region’s most comprehensive network of social service programs. Today, we serve over 10,000 individuals annually across Kanawha, Boone, and Clay counties through life-saving services including emergency shelter, permanent housing, job readiness, senior enrichment, and domestic violence intervention.

