th is not optional for women’s health—it’s foundational.—Beyond my work in biotech and Roar, I have an entrepreneurial background spanning real estate and early-stage business building. I’m passionate about developing people, building high-performing teams, and creating systems that scale impact.If there’s a throughline in my career, it’s this:Take what we know—and make it actually work in the real world.",No,,,,,,United States,California,San Francisco,founder,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/michelle-kunkel,ROAR,2-10,13,wellness and fitness services,,"ROAR is a San Francisco–based strength training studio brand dedicated to empowering women through structured programming, elevated environments, and strong community culture.

