Craig,Shimasaki,President & CEO,Moleculera Biosciences,President & CEO at Moleculera Biosciences,"Leading Moleculera Biosciences as President and CEO, my mission is to impact change in how medicine is practiced for those suffering from chronic immune-mediated disorders.  Our focus is on precision medicine,  identifying novel biological targets and utilizing molecular diagnostics to direct targeted treatments for immune-mediated disorders. Our innovative molecular testing panels and data-rich biorepositories are identifying new biomarkers and targets for therapy to address many treatment-resistant neuropsychiatric and cardiovascular disorders and early detection of autoimmune Alzheimer's disease.

