Afia,Asamoah,"Co-founder, General Counsel, Corporate Secretary, and Head of Strategic Alliances",Waymark,"Co-Founder of Waymark | Health Tech Leader | General Counsel | Ex-FDA, Verily, Google Health | Board Director & Audit Chair","I remember my time in college, working with pediatricians at Boston Medical Center, supporting students with sickle cell disease, wondering why we settle for a system where everyone does not have access to quality healthcare. I am passionate about changing that – building systems that  address systemic inequality in healthcare, especially for vulnerable populations.  

I seek to constantly learn, solve hard problems, and improve myself and the healthcare system we all interact with. 

I am currently trying to deliver better health to as many patients as possible with Medicaid benefits, building teams, culture, and a sustainable, scaling business model as co-founder of Waymark, using automated and AI enabled technology to do so.  I have so much gratitude for the team I have the privilege to build with, growing the company to over 100+, partnered with large health systems and health plans, serving patients in Washington, Virginia, and Ohio.

