Laura,Orange,Nurse Practitioner,Plumas District Hospital,"Nurse PractitionerFounder, We Run the StatesOwner, Á L’Orange Med SpaDirector of Perinatal Services, PDH","My first undergraduate degree, BS in Kinesiology with focus on exercise science taught the importance of movement relative to the human body's ability to respond to their environment.  I continued my academic journey with an accelerated bachelor of science in Nursing at Creighton University.

