Drew,Schiller,"Co-Founder & CEO, Board of Directors Member",Validic,"Healthcare, data, and strategy. CEO, Validic. Founder, board member, advisor.","I work at the intersection of healthcare, data, and strategy, helping enterprises adopt innovation and innovators navigate healthcare.

I’m co-founder and CEO of Validic, where we’ve spent the past decade focused on one core problem: making continuous, real-world health data useful in clinical care. Our platform integrates personal health data into the EHR so clinicians can see how patients are actually doing between visits and act earlier.

When this works, care becomes more proactive. Health systems can prioritize the patients who need attention most, improve outcomes, and reduce avoidable utilization while making better use of limited capacity.

I spend a lot of time thinking about how healthcare systems evolve. Most are still built around episodic interactions, even as data becomes continuous. Bridging that gap requires more than technology. It takes changes in workflow, incentives, and how organizations make decisions.

Beyond Validic, I work with companies across healthcare and technology as an advisor and board member. My focus is on data strategy, system design, and how AI can be applied in ways that actually work in real-world care environments.

I’ve served on multiple industry and advisory boards, including the Consumer Technology Association Health Division Board, where I previously served as Chair, and the AWS Health Tech Advisory Board. My work has centered on advancing interoperability, digital health, and data-driven care.

