David Benshoof,Klein,Founder & CEO,"Click Therapeutics, Inc.",Founder & CEO of Click Therapeutics,"David Benshoof Klein is a healthcare innovator and entrepreneur with more than 20 years of experience in the life science industry and a passion for developing novel patient-centric treatments. 

