Kimberly,"Caspare DPT, ATC, CSCS, CES","Founder, President of Physical Therapy and Wellness Operations",PHIT Well,Performance Physical Therapy Consultant for NBA and NHL,"Dr. Kimberly Caspare DPT, ATC, CSCS, CES is breaking down the barriers of physical rehabilitation in the professional sports space and through founding state of the art clinics in New York City. 

She co-founded PHIT Well in 2021, a state of the art orthopedic wellness center integrating physical therapy, athletic training and personal training in order to collectively provide a dialed-in approach to support patients, clients and athletes. 

