ow proprietary formulations that target a broad range of indications. We have established multiple alliances, licenses and other business relationships with the world’s leading pharmaceutical companies including Amgen, Merck, Pfizer, Jazz, Gilead Sciences and Baxter International.",http://www.ligand.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/ligand-pharmaceuticals,PUBLIC_COMPANY,0,5000000-10000000,1320100000,POST_IPO_DEBT,ligand.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
