Denice,Torres,Member Board of Directors,Celldex,"Board Member | Former J&J and Lilly Executive | P&L, Strategy, Risk & Culture | Human Performance & Happiness | Author & Global Top 3% Podcast Host","For over 25 years, I led large businesses across pharma, consumer health, and medtech—organizations dedicated to making a meaningful difference in people’s lives. I served as president of several multi-billion-dollar companies and as Chief Strategy & Transformation Officer for a $20B+ enterprise.

