Harry,Jackson,Chief Executive Officer,360 Human Services,Chief Executive Officer at 360 Human Services,"Harry Jackson is the visionary architect and CEO of 360 Human Services. Hailing from Compton, California, Harry's childhood experiences of witnessing the struggles of impoverished people and moving around frequently inspired him to address the lack of access to quality services in underserved communities.

Growing up in a family of four boys and four girls, Harry's brother struggled with behavioral issues from a young age. When his brother was diagnosed with a condition that led to a clinician recommending medication, Harry's parents were faced with a difficult choice. Despite their reservations, they agreed to the treatment for fear of being accused of child abuse. However, the medications significantly impacted his brother's personality and well-being.

A year later, Harry's brother's behavioral issues escalated, culminating in an incident involving matches that left Harry with third-degree burns. His brother was placed in a mental institution, and his parents faced the heart-wrenching decision to either send him away or risk having all their children removed from the home. This experience profoundly shaped Harry's perspective on behavioral health services and ignited his passion for providing quality services to underserved communities.

Jackson Family Human Services is dedicated to delivering high-quality ABA therapy services to families in need, particularly those in rural and inner-city underserved communities. Harry's goal is to help children with behavioral issues achieve their full potential and lead happy, healthy lives. He believes that all children deserve access to the best possible care, irrespective of their background or circumstances.

Through his work, Harry aspires to make a meaningful impact on the lives of children and families in need and create a more equitable and just society for all. His life goal is to ensure that families of all races, religions, and economic statuses have access to high-quality services, ultimately making the world a better place because he was here.",No,,,,,,United States,California,Los Angeles Metropolitan Area,c_suite,"c_suite, master_human_resources",https://www.linkedin.com/in/harry-jackson-3954a01a1,360 Human Services,11-50,37,hospitals and health care,,"Since 2019, JFHS has been paving the way in ABA, focusing on underrepresented communities gaining access to vital resources that can improve behavior and lead to a better quality of life. Our team of 
Dedicated professionals utilize ABA strategies and principles in an individual's naturalistic environment to consumers and families to help develop the essential items they need to thrive – at home, at school, and in their community. 
Since 2019, JFHS philosophy has provided Platinum Standard services of high quality, healthy, caring, and compassionate behavioral health services to adults and children, ages 0-59, locally, regionally, and globally.
JFHS ABA therapy emerged as a Solution to underrepresented, aversive, and historically questionable treatment carried out in therapy on those with autism. With our team of caring professionals, JFHS has built a trusted brand in the industry in ABA practices. Endorsed by the Behavior Analyst Certification Board (BACB), this also holds our therapist to higher mandatory competency standards and professional scope of practice. JFHS is committed to attracting, recruiting, hiring, training, and retaining high-quality, compassionate, and culturally competent employees.
JFHS is keen on social responsibility and being a responsible, ethical, and principled corporate citizen. Community outreach and involvement are paramount. JFHS is pioneering the platinum standard health service that not only satisfies our clients but delights them. We aim to exceed our client’s expectations. Customer Delight and Experience is our focus. JFHS has created the perfect method to serve our customers in behavioral health services, daycare, and adult care.",https://360humanservices.com/join-our-team,https://www.linkedin.com/company/360-human-services,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,1000000-5000000,,,360humanservices.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
