Dr. Scott,Asnis,Founder & CEO,Dental365,Founder & CEO of Dental365 & Premier Care Dental Management | Leader in Dental Innovation & Practice Management | Building the Future of Patient-Centered Dental Care 🦷,"I started my dental career with a passion for patient care and patient experience. Being their advocate was my focus, and I believed the dental industry could do more to support both the doctors and the patients. That belief became a mission: to build a model of care that supports doctors, expands access, and puts patients at the center of everything we do.

