At Dental365 and Leading Edge, we’re not just aggregating practices under a business umbrella. We’re building something different, what we call a ‘Dental Clinical Organization’ (DCO). It’s a model that prioritizes clinical autonomy, peer collaboration, and evidence-based care. In a DCO, doctors lead the way. Patient care isn’t compromised for growth; it’s the reason we grow.

At the core of our work is Dentistry Done Right, a commitment to clinical excellence, continuous learning, and compassionate care. We invest in our providers, embrace innovation, and never lose sight of why we’re here: to improve lives through better health.

We’re also looking ahead. Dentistry is no longer siloed from the rest of healthcare. Through our work in Molecular Dentistry and advanced diagnostics, we’re helping identify at-risk patients earlier and collaborating across disciplines to treat the whole person, not just the mouth.

Dental365 is more than a dental group. It’s a healthcare platform for the future. And I’m grateful to be on this journey with an incredible team of clinicians, leaders, and partners who share that vision.

