The industry had no standardized, reliable, plenum-rated mounting solutions for basic HVAC components.

Field guys improvised.
Engineers had no consistent spec to write.
Supply houses had nothing standardized to stock.

So my business partner, Stephen Winalski, and I decided to fix it.

Together, we built BARRSKI Products, focused on designing practical, American-made HVAC innovations that make installs cleaner, safer, and faster:
	•	Barrski Bracket — a universal, plenum-ready, UL 2043–rated mounting bracket for condensate pumps
	•	Barrski Interlink Pipe Saddles — a modular, link-together pipe saddle system for copper, hydronic, domestic water, VRF, and refrigeration line sets

Both products are Made in the USA and engineered to give the HVAC industry something it has never had: standardized, labor-saving, plenum-rated mounting solutions that installers trust, engineers can spec with confidence, and supply houses can stock consistently.

After 30+ years in the field, I’m committed to solving real problems with practical, efficient, Made-in-America solutions that make everyday HVAC installs easier for the next generation of tradespeople.

