Doug,Hetherington,CEO & Program Architect,Health2Business,"Direct Contracting, Community Health Plan Architect, Healthcare Innovation","""What if hospitals put community and true partnerships as their highest priority, partnerships that create a sustainable healthcare offering, partnerships designed to assist employers and their employees improve their healthcare experience, and partnerships better aligned with the hospital's true mission?""

At H2B (HealtH2Business), we believe in giving everyone in a community the opportunity to have sustainable and meaningful healthcare. We accomplish this by creating a vehicle for employers to form direct business partnerships with their local hospitals and doctors. By shifting how businesses access and pay for healthcare (moving away from insurance providers like Blue Cross, United, Cigna, Aetna, Humana, etc.), employers achieve sustainable annual healthcare costs and can deliver  employee healthcare plans that are second to none.
 
How it works:
· H2B assists local hospitals and doctors to create a Direct to Employer benefits program. 
· H2B helps employers structure their benefit plan  so  they can participate in the Direct to Employer program. 
· Employers join into the Direct to Employer program.  Now both Employers and Hospitals and Doctors get to enjoy the benefits of their direct business partnership! 

Direct partnerships between employers and healthcare providers are tried-and-true. We are happy to assist you in exploring if this is the right fit for you and your employees. This video explains how this model works in greater detail: https://vimeo.com/367262222

Below is my direct calendar link. Consider scheduling a time to talk more. 
https://health2business.com/schedule-a-call/",Yes,,,,,,United States,Idaho,Kimberly,c_suite,"c_suite, medical_health",https://www.linkedin.com/in/doug-hetherington,Health2Business,2-10,6,hospitals and health care,,"Health2Business (H2B) establishes and administers direct contracts and builds infrastructure that enables healthcare providers and hospital systems to offer services directly to employer health plans without going through third parties.  This results in better access to care at more affordable rates.

Founded by a former 20-year Benefit Advisor and a former Healthcare Provider, H2B solutions simultaneously address Employer pain and Provider pain and seek to generate mutually-beneficial results. Direct contracts have a proven, profoundly beneficial impact on the communities they serve.

Services: 

1. Products: Turnkey level-fund and self-funded health plans* for small group to enterprise that feature access to H2B direct contracts (*H2B is not a health plan)
2. Access:  H2B direct contracts layer into existing or new self-funded health plans
3. Direct Contract Administration:  Independent and agnostic administration of direct contracts
4. Consulting: Build out direct contract programs for employers or providers

Direct Contract Administration

H2B’s independent and agnostic infrastructure solutions are a new vendor class known as Direct Contract Administration (DCA). We are not affiliated with or owned by another company. Our unbiased DCA vendor class enables H2B to partner collaboratively with all interested employers, benefit consultants/advisors/brokers, third-party administrators (TPAs), repricers and other vendors, health systems, and providers in the self-funded or level-funded space. H2B is not an insurance carrier, TPA, benefit consultant, broker, or broker to the broker (General Agency (GA) or Managing General Agent (MGA)).

H2B believes Providers can help solve access and affordability challenges plaguing our dysfunctional healthcare system. Collaborating to decapitalize healthcare and change the way we pay for services will result in sustainable, aligned incentives for Provider, Employer and Employee/Patient stakeholders.",http://www.health2business.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/health2business,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,100000-500000,,,health2business.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
Susan,Benigas,Executive Director,American College of Lifestyle Medicine,Chief Executive Officer at The American College of Lifestyle Medicine,"My life motto: Fearlessly, faithfully moving forward, leaving no stone unturned. When working tirelessly to shift our nation's sick care system to true HEALTH care, vision, dedication, tenacity, grit, determination, fearlessness, and resourcefulness are all essential!  

