Earle,Holsapple III,Founder and CEO,"SciTech Development, Inc.","CEO of SciTech Development, a clinical stage oncology-focused pharmaceutical company","Earle Holsapple III is the CEO and Founder of SciTech Development, Inc., a Michigan-based biopharmaceutical company advancing breakthrough therapies in oncology through innovative nanotechnology. Under his leadership, SciTech has developed its lead drug candidate, ST-001 nanoFenretinide, a patented nanoparticle formulation currently in clinical trials for T-cell lymphoma and preparing to enter trials for small cell lung cancer.

With a career rooted in entrepreneurship and healthcare innovation, Earle has guided SciTech from its origins as a spin-off of the Karmanos Cancer Institute and Wayne State University into a company recognized for its  groundbreaking approach to solving one of oncology’s most persistent challenges: low drug bioavailability. His focus is on building value through rigorous science, strategic partnerships, and a vision to bring safer, more effective cancer therapies to patients in need.

More About SciTech:
