ad.Vitanya began as a collaboration between holistic health and entrepreneurial visionaries. Today, it is a force multiplier, empowering individuals, strengthening families, supporting high-stress professions, and helping communities build measurable resilience.Our purpose is simple but profound: resilient brains build resilient communities.Our goal is audacious: to make measurable brain performance and mental fitness as universal as access to the internet itself.",No,,,,,,United States,Arizona,Greater Phoenix Area,founder,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/michael-southworth-25b16813,Vitanya Brain Performance,11-50,40,wellness and fitness services,,"Reimagining resilience & building brain capital.  Vitanya serves those who serve - from veterans and first responders to professionals in high-pressure environments. We are a science-backed performance partner, pioneering a new standard in mental wellness and cognitive resilience through personalized, non-invasive neuroscience.  Our team combines clinical expertise, cutting-edge neuro-technology, and a commitment to public-private partnerships to deliver real, measurable results - helping people sleep better, focus deeper, lead smarter, and live fuller.",http://vitanya.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/vitanya-brain-performance,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,1000000-5000000,,,vitanya.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
