Dr. Adetoro (Toro),O.,Chief Pharmacy Officer,"Total Health Care, Inc.","Healthcare Executive & Leadership Advisor | AI Platform Innovator | Board Governance & CEO Succession | Founder, Quantum 5D Consulting, LLC","I am a healthcare executive, leadership advisor, and technology innovator with 17+ years of experience driving enterprise transformation across multi-site, mission-driven organizations. My work sits at the intersection of three things I am deeply passionate about: building high-performing leaders, creating organizational accountability systems, and using technology to make governance visible and actionable.

