▶  Board Governance Suite — an AI-powered HRSA OSV compliance and board governance platform. When federal auditors saw it during a live site visit, they said unprompted: “You should be selling this.”

▶  Meeting Intelligence Platform — an enterprise accountability system that transforms any meeting into a structured action and KPI dashboard with role-based access and CEO decision queues.

Both platforms carry U.S. Copyright Office preregistrations under Quantum 5D Consulting, LLC — the consulting entity I founded to commercialize these tools across the 1,400+ FQHC market nationally.

