Jacquie,Elcox,Co-Founder,"Auris Practice Solutions, LLC",A Leader in Hearing Healthcare | Visionary Entrepreneur | Advocate for Excellence,"For over 30 years, I've been dedicated to hearing healthcare—leading in private practice, corporate leadership, and industry innovation. My focus has always been on patient care, business growth, and expanding access to hearing solutions with a patient-first approach.

