Will,Akers,Co-Founder and Chief Strategy Officer,"Switchboard, MD","Clinical Triage, Seamless Scheduling, Powered by Voice AI","After spending over a decade in Asia helping organizations adopt newer, more efficient technologies, I moved back to the U.S. in 2022 and reconnected with my college roommate - an internal medicine physician and former CHIO of the Atlanta VA. He was burned out, overwhelmed by the daily flood of patient messages that were pulling him further away from patient care and into administrative tasks like updating a pharmacy address or filling out forms for the DMV.  

