Your health happens everywhere else.

Patients don't deteriorate in exam rooms. They drift quietly at home — between visits and after discharge - where the system has historically been blind. That's where outcomes are won or lost.

ONEai Health built the solution.
We created the Continuous Care Intelligence Nexus (CCIN) — the network layer for continuous care in a fragmented healthcare world. It connects patients, providers, payers, researchers, and partners through a shared infrastructure that turns longitudinal patient signals into coordinated, closed-loop care at scale.

The CCI Platform delivers:
*Earlier awareness of meaningful clinical change
*Coordinated intervention routed to the right care team role
*Documented follow-through between visits
*Measurable outcomes tracked across populations

Powered by Pixie — our Predictive Care Intelligence engine — ONEai generates explainable next-best actions from longitudinal patient signals and delivers them to the right clinician at the right time, then closes the loop by tracking whether they worked.

Healthcare moves from episodic encounters to continuous care - finally operational.

