Ari,Brenner,Founder & CEO,In-House Health,"Founder, In-House Health: AI-driven scheduling & management tech platform for modern nursing teams | Founder, Stellar Health","I’m a career-long devotee to improving healthcare delivery and payment models. I have a deep track record of recruiting operationally excellent teams, building digital health products with clear value propositions and navigating the complexities of selling into the US healthcare system.",No,,,,,,United States,Colorado,Denver,founder,"c_suite, medical_health",https://www.linkedin.com/in/aribrenner,In-House Health,11-50,43,hospitals and health care,,"""In the wake of the pandemic, as headlines piled up describing mounting shortages at the bedside, we watched in wonder as external staffing agencies grew rapidly and seemed always in the spotlight. All we ever heard from our friends, family and colleagues in nursing was frustration about overreliance on agency ('I would have taken that shift! Why did it go to an agency nurse?'). Despite this, the problems in the nursing workforce seemed to be increasingly answered by 'we'll outsource'. As we dug deeper, we recognized that the rise in agency was driven not just by extra pay, but particularly by the flexibility and control that going to agency gave nurses, which they could not find as full-time employees of health systems.

This is where the name 'In-House' comes from: our firm belief that with the right tools, nursing workforces from within the care delivery system can structure themselves effectively to respond to the mounting crisis, meet the ever-rising demand for nursing care, and again make bedside nursing a career of choice that draws aspiring healthcare professionals.""

Ari, Sergey & Shachar 
