m founding to commercial launch🔹 Led the R&amp;D execution that secured $38M+ in milestone-based funding🔹 Invented foundational IP anchoring a $35M+ partnership with J&amp;J🔹 Built and scaled a 12-person R&amp;D organization from the ground up🔹 Engineered a strategic pivot that preserved 100% founder equity through a partnership-funded model🔹 18 issued US utility patents across microfluidic cell processing and filtrationI welcome connections with founders, executives, and investors building the future of deep tech in healthcare.Outside of work, I'm an avid runner, reader, and Formula 1 enthusiast.",No,,,,,,United States,Massachusetts,Cambridge,founder,"master_engineering_technical, master_information_technology, c_suite",https://www.linkedin.com/in/kylecsmith,BendBio,2-10,6,biotechnology research,,"BendBio provides the core inertial microfluidics engine for next-generation cell therapy manufacturing systems.

