Abbas,Kazimi,Chief Executive Officer,Nimbus Therapeutics,Chief Executive Officer at Nimbus Therapeutics | Board Member,"Abbas Kazimi is the Chief Executive Officer of Nimbus Therapeutics and a Member of the Board of Directors. Previously, he served as Chief Business Officer, leading the company’s strategic and corporate development efforts while overseeing business operations. Since joining Nimbus in 2014, he has helped raise over $630 million in equity financing and led corporate and business development transactions totaling over $8 billion.

