Gertrude,Bett,Legal Associate,Kössit Technologies,"Founder and CEO Kössit Technologies | Everyone deserves a clean restroom experience.                                                                 LLB,PDL,LLM,Doctor of Business Administration.","Kössit Technologies is a venture that sits closest to my heart. It was born not in a boardroom but in a public restroom.As a mother, I know the quiet struggle of navigating public spaces with a young child. Restaurants, hospitals, Churches, Airports, Schools — every outing included the anxiety of public restroom hygiene. I would sanitize the seat, layer toilet paper to create a makeshift barrier, and still feel uncertain. The paper would slip, tear, or fall into the bowl. Nothing worked reliably. That frustration stayed with me.That is why I founded Kössit Technologies — to solve a problem that millions of people face every day but rarely talk about. Kössit’s smart toilet seat system delivers a fresh, disposable HDPE film barrier with every single use, activated by a simple button press or wave of the hand. Users literally watch the film change in front of them, guaranteeing hygiene in real time. No paper covers that slip, clog drains, or crack the seat. No guesswork. Just clean, every time.Kössit is designed for gymnasiums, hotels, airports, malls, office buildings, and exhibition centers — anywhere cleanliness defines the guest experience. For facility operators, the system reduces labor, maintenance costs, and complaints. For users, it restores confidence and dignity in a space that should feel safe. A win-win for everyone.We are building a hygiene-tech company that makes smart, touch-free, beautifully designed restroom experiences the new standard — starting with the public spaces that need it most.If you manage facilities, invest in wellness infrastructure, or simply believe that everyone deserves a clean seat — let’s connect.📩 Open to partnerships, B2B inquiries, investor conversations, and speaking engagements.",Yes,,,,,,United States,Washington,Greater Seattle Area,founder,master_legal,https://www.linkedin.com/in/gertrudebett,Refugee Women’s Alliance (ReWA),51-200,129,individual and family services,,"Refugee Women's Alliance (ReWA) is a non-profit, multi-ethnic organization that promotes inclusion, independence, personal leadership, and strong communities by providing refugee and immigrant women and their families with culturally and linguistically appropriate services. ReWA advocates for social justice, public policy changes, and equal access to services while respecting cultural values and the right to self-determination.",http://www.rewa.org,https://www.linkedin.com/company/refugee-women-s-alliance,NON_PROFIT,0,5000000-10000000,2500000,GRANT,rewa.org,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
