Raj,Bhatnagar,CEO,Neolytix,"CEO, Neolytix | Healthcare operations are becoming software. We’re building that future for Healthcare Provider Organizations.","Neolytix was founded on a simple grievance: healthcare providers were trusting their billing partners with their financial health, and that trust was being exploited. The data was manipulated, the metrics were designed to protect the vendor, and the providers - the people trying to run practices and take care of patients - had no real visibility into their own revenue. We built Neolytix to fix that. Not as another billing company, but as a management services partner with deep domain knowledge across revenue cycle management, credentialing, enrollment, payer analytics, and patient access. Our teams operate from the US, India, and the Philippines - and the reason we win isn't scale. It's that we've spent over a decade compounding the kind of niche, regulation-level operational knowledge that many organizations chasing scale, will never invest in building. We know how payer contracts actually work, how state licensing boards actually process applications, where claims actually break. That knowledge is our moat. Now we're converting that expertise into software. Services as Software (SaaSw) to be precise - the thesis that the best managed operations don't just get more efficient, they become progressively autonomous. We're building proprietary platforms and AI-powered workflows that encode what our teams know into systems that scale without losing the intelligence. Healthcare administration is the engine that determines whether patients receive care and providers get paid. We intend to make that engine run better than it ever has.",Yes,,,,,,United States,Illinois,Chicago,c_suite,"c_suite, medical_health",https://www.linkedin.com/in/netrajat,Neolytix,201-500,188,hospitals and health care,,"Neolytix is a trusted management partner for healthcare organizations, delivering tailored support across revenue cycle and admi