Ren,Menon,Cofounder and CEO,OrthoFX,"Co-Founder and CEO, OrthoFX","I started OrthoFX with a simple belief: alignment matters — not just in orthodontics, but in life.

When things are aligned, systems work better. Teeth move more predictably. Doctors and patients communicate more clearly. Care becomes simpler, not more complicated.

But for too long, orthodontics has been treated as a product business — design a tray, ship it, and hope the biology cooperates. Real care doesn’t work that way. Orthodontic treatment is a dynamic process that requires continuous observation, course correction, and partnership between doctor and patient.

At OrthoFX, we’re building a different model.

We started with materials science, developing patented polymers designed to deliver more consistent forces and improve treatment efficiency and comfort. But technology alone doesn’t solve the problem. What matters is the system around it.

That’s why we’ve built tools like FXOnTrack™ to monitor treatment remotely and Rescue Aligners™ to correct problems early — keeping patients on track without unnecessary resets or disruptions. Our goal is simple: give doctors the visibility and control they need to guide treatment the way it should be guided.

Over time, this vision expands beyond aligners.

The mouth is not separate from the rest of the body. Oral health connects to systemic health — from inflammation and sleep to overall wellness. As orthodontic care becomes more connected and data-driven, the aligner itself can become more than a passive device. It can become part of a broader platform that supports long-term health, not just straighter teeth.

That’s the future we’re building toward: a system where treatment, monitoring, retention, and lifelong smile maintenance are connected through a single platform — one that empowers doctors and supports patients throughout their lives.

Technology matters. But alignment between people matters even more.

Because when doctors, patients, and technology work together as one team, the outcomes are better for everyone.

#OneTeam",No,,,,,,United States,California,San Francisco Bay Area,founder,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/renmenon,OrthoFX,51-200,133,wellness and fitness services,,"OrthoFX™ was established by a group of pioneers in the clear aligner industry who were instrumental in advancing and scaling leading aligner brands. The founders of OrthoFX saw an opportunity to improve treatment predictability and patient compliance by reimagining next-generation polymers, software, and services. Their goal was to empower doctors to provide effective, efficient aligner systems while offering patients aligner options that fit with their daily lifestyle.

The OrthoFX portfolio of products include: 

FXClear™: Custom-made aligners delivering predictable results. Its stain-resistant material and smooth, scalloped edges allow for enhanced comfort and fit. Its advanced polymer technology exerts gentle, optimal pressure and requires 20-22 hours of wear time per day, similar to the wear time requirements of leading aligner brands.

FXBright™: A brighter alternative! FXBright is a translucent aligner that gives teeth a naturally whiter and straighter appearance, without the use of whitening gels, from day one of treatment. FXBright also requires 20-22 hours of wear time per day.

AirFlex™: The first and only FDA-cleared aligner demonstrated to straighten teeth with at least 9-12 hours of continuous daily wear time*. This is 50% less wear time versus the leading aligner clear brands. 
