Shirley,Billigmeier,Author and Consultant,INNERGETICS,Creator and Founder of Innergetics which is the permanent solution to all eating and weight issues.  Author of Inner Eating.  Online course with one-on-one coaching,"I created Innergetics to resolve all eating and weight issues without drugs.  We are born with our natural eating boundaries - hunger and taste.  We just stopped listening.  

Even though I had a strong supportive upbringing, I still had this angst regarding my body size and what I needed to eat to be healthy.  Once I started teaching, I realized my students also had this angst that was interfering with their daily lives. Their thoughts were consumed by what they were eating and not eating and frustrated with their body size.  Eating was out of order.  Eating was meant to give us energy, not drain our energy.

After teaching for 6 years, I knew my mission was to get eating back in order.  After the birth of our first child, my aha moment came from watching my child have very strong eating boundaries.  She knew when to start eating and she certainly let me know when she wanted to stop eating!  

There were some researchers who understood hunger but there was nothing available to guide individuals on how to reconnect to hunger.  My research led to the publishing of my book, Inner Eating with the foreward written by Dr. Michael Jensen of the Mayo Clinic.  

I was asked to speak at the Summit on Compulsive Eating: Treatment At The Crossroads in 1994 in Denver, Colorado. I realized again that all the rules of eating were interfering with our natural eating boundaries.  

I created my company, Innergetics, in 1994, which is the process of resurfacing the natural eating boundaries without drugs. The eating boundaries are within our gut-brain.  The gut brain was finally recognized by the medical community in 1999 when Dr. Michael Gershon named it the enteric brain.

Throughout these years I have continued to refine the Innergetics Process to develop a multitude of tools so everyone can resurface the joy of eating while being in a body they love living in. We are not meant to have extra storage - that is for a famine and, as of yet, no one has predicted a famine in the near future.  Storage is my term for fat because it is stored information that we need to understand its purpose and release to reclaim our own bodies.  

There is no failure in the Inngetics Process because it is a pathway back to your original boundaries, hunger, and taste. The key is total choice of all foods.  This is about empowering the individual because whoever owns the choice owns the power.  We need to reclaim our own choices of what sustains our life - food - to rediscover the joy of eating while living in a body we love living in.",No,,,,,,United States,Minnesota,Long Lake,founder,consulting,https://www.linkedin.com/in/shirleybilligmeier,INNERGETICS,2-10,5,wellness and fitness services,,INNERGETICS,http://www.innergetics.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/innergetics,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,100000-500000,,,innergetics.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
