Steve,Biljan,Co-Founder + Chief Commercial Officer,evolvedMD,Co-Founder with Minnesota roots | Behavioral Health Reformer | Growth Strategist | Depression Survivor | Systems Thinker Who Still Loves High School Hockey and Prince,"I’ve always been driven by the question: How can we deliver better care—faster, earlier, and smarter, especially for the people who are too often left behind?

Before co-founding evolvedMD, I spent years building national growth strategies in healthcare. But it wasn’t until I went through my own mental health crisis – burnout, grief, and depression – that I fully understood the cracks in our system. I knew I needed help. But I didn’t know where to turn. Like so many others, I was never screened. Never connected. Never asked.

That’s what drives me today.

As Chief Commercial Officer at evolvedMD, I lead strategy across sales, marketing, and payer relations – focused on helping health systems embed collaborative care directly into primary care. We’ve proven that when behavioral health is team-based, local, and fully integrated, everything improves: earlier diagnosis, stronger outcomes, lower cost of care, and higher physician satisfaction.

The work is personal. I believe in starting before you're ready. In solving problems by acting, not just planning. A mentor once told me: “Action creates action.” It stuck. Because I’ve seen that momentum. Done right it’s the difference between a good idea and lasting change.

People tell me I’m fast, focused, and wired for pattern recognition. I love building something with a mission. I’m not above any job I ask someone else to do. And I believe you lead best when you lead by example.

I grew up in Minnesota, now live in San Diego, and still think the high school hockey tournament is one of the most magical events of the year. I’m into native plants, long runs, and listening to Prince maybe a little too loud.

