 a course that will help them thrive. We will assess and strategically help you build the Human Capital and constantly monitor the wellbeing of your family, walking alongside you each step of the way. Our clients seek out the Legacy Forum for its proven record, providing bespoke and concierge services tailored to your family’s needs. We have pioneered a process that combines the best of both foundational and cutting-edge practices to serve a select and very exclusive group of UHNW individuals and families over the past 35 years. We offer expertly crafted products and services to help our clients develop shared values, bridge divides, and leverage innate talents. We believe that every family aspires to live and leave a legacy they can be proud of.  The Legacy Forum is your choice! www.thelegacyforum.com",Yes,,,,,,United States,Texas,Dallas,founder,"c_suite, master_human_resources, consulting",https://www.linkedin.com/in/markdemos,The Legacy Forum,11-50,7,individual and family services,,"The Legacy Forum™ is the leading concierge firm providing bespoke programs and services to ultra-high-net-worth (UHNW) clients who want to build and protect their Family Legacy.

We build Legacy by utilizing our signature, retreat-based FORUMs, tailored to the specific needs and goals of each individual and family, based on our powerful Legacy Advising and Development Model.

We have worked to protect Family Legacy for over 30 years, providing mental health and coaching services to UHNW families, helping them navigate issues such as stress, anxiety, depression, substance-abuse, mental illness, failure to launch, and reputation management.

A Camden survey of H/UHNW Families, 71% were aware of or were directly affected by a family member’s struggle with mental health or addiction. 84% were concerned about potential damage.

We work with our clients to analyze the past by identifying the values and actions that you want to discard and those to celebrate, repeat, and develop as a foundation for your Legacy.

In addition, we partner with you to perform a thorough inventory and analysis of your assets, both financial and human, and leverage them to build your vision and future.

The Legacy Forum™ will dream with you as you create an enduring legacy, by building strong family systems, but more importantly, individuals who know and use their talents, and live lives personified by moral values and virtues.

