Nate,"Scott, MBA",FOUNDER & CEO,"Life Is Rich Global, LLC","Strategic Clarity Advisor to Executives & Founders.            Helping leaders sequence decisions that scale in the AI-era | West Point | Former CFO | Certified AI Consultant | AI, Leadership & Finance","Most leadership failures don’t come from a lack of intelligence, effort, or ambition.

They come from decisions made out of sequence—clarity deferred, governance postponed, speed chosen before judgment. The consequences rarely show up immediately. They surface later as culture erosion, margin compression, strategic drift, or complexity no one feels equipped to unwind.

My work sits at that intersection.

I advise executives and founders who are scaling responsibility, complexity, and consequence—often faster than their decision architecture has matured. The role is not to motivate or perform confidence. It is to slow the right moments, clarify what actually matters, and help leaders sequence decisions so growth compounds rather than corrodes.

My background spans leadership, finance, and technology, including service as a U.S. Army officer, executive responsibility as a former CFO, and advisory work at the intersection of AI, governance, and scale. That range matters because tools amplify what already exists. Discipline becomes leverage. Confusion becomes expensive.

I don’t sell tactics.
I don’t optimize for speed.
I work with leaders who understand that clarity precedes profitable scale—and that judgment is the real constraint.

Engagements are selective, trust-based, and focused on long-term outcomes rather than short-term optics.

If you are navigating scale and feel the weight of decisions that will outlive the current quarter, we will likely have a productive conversation.

My work currently focuses on a small number of executive advisory relationships and a broader leadership platform through Life Is Rich Global.",Yes,,,,,,United States,Florida,Jacksonville,founder,"c_suite, consulting",https://www.linkedin.com/in/natescott,"Life Is Rich Global, LLC",11-50,6,wellness and fitness services,,"Life Is Rich Global, LLC specializes in providing a principle-centered leadership program designed to address the financial concerns associated with retirement planning, particularly geared towards individuals aged 35-45 earning less than $225,000. Drawing inspiration from the book ""Life Is Rich: How To Create Lasting Wealth"", our mission revolves around assisting individuals in envisioning and achieving a fulfilling life by focusing on the last 10 years of their journey.

We offer a holistic plan that encompasses spiritual, mental, emotional, relational, physical, and financial aspects, guiding individuals to align their lives with Biblical principles. Moreover, we work with business owners to enhance the value of their current book of business and create sustainable, predictable, repeatable, and scalable income streams.

At Life Is Rich Global, we provide tangible outcomes including financial security, optimal health and vitality, a sense of purpose within one's current life season, and the freedom to pursue personal aspirations at one's convenience. Explore how we can help transform your business and personal life by visiting our website at [Life Is Rich Global](www.LifeIsRichGlobal.com).",https://www.LifeIsRichGlobal.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/lifeisrichglobal,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,100000-500000,,,838.2623,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
