Erich,Wolf,Founder and CTO,Wavegate,Founder and CTO at Wavegate Corporation,,No,,,,,,United States,Louisiana,Lake Charles,founder,"master_information_technology, c_suite",https://www.linkedin.com/in/erich-wolf-b3726911,Wavegate Corporation,2-10,6,medical equipment manufacturing,,"Wavegate is a clinical-stage neuromodulation company redefining chronic pain therapy through intelligent adaptive control.
Wavegate’s Ellipse™ spinal cord stimulation platform integrates real-time optical and physiological sensing for closed-loop control with intelligent software to deliver more consistent, personalized therapy for chronic pain. By moving beyond static, open-loop stimulation, Wavegate’s technology continuously adjusts therapy in response to patient-specific physiology and activity—independent of the need for patient-perceived stimulation—supporting consistent therapeutic dosing across a wide range of operating conditions.
At the core of the platform is Active Loop™, a proprietary control system architecture that combines optical sensing, electrophysiological monitoring, embedded intelligence, and adaptive dosing to maintain therapeutic effectiveness across daily activities and anatomical variability while remaining agnostic to stimulation waveform. Active Loop™ regulates therapy based on objective physiological and optical field-level stability metrics. This approach reduces variability in pain relief, minimizes programming burden, and extends therapy longevity—benefiting patients, clinicians, and healthcare systems alike.
Wavegate’s multidisciplinary team brings deep expertise across neuromodulation, biomedical engineering, optics, AI-driven software, and medical device development. Our core mission is to deliver smarter, more responsive neuromodulation—transforming how spinal cord stimulation is programmed, optimized, and experienced.
Active Loop™ and the Ellipse™ spinal cord stimulation platform are investigational technologies and have not yet been evaluated or approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.",https://wavegate.us,https://www.linkedin.com/company/wavegatecorporation,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,100000-500000,31219491,SERIES_UNKNOWN,wavegate.us,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
Susanna,Bair,"President, Co-Founder, Author, Teacher",iamHeart,"Author, Teacher, President & Co-Founder of the Institute for Applied Meditation on the Heart (iamHeart)","I teach spiritual practices for stress resiliency, goal setting, personal and professional success, spiritual deepening, and healing psychological wounds. My current focus in my work is women’s spirituality, specifically in helping women find renewed purpose after motherhood.

I help mothers change their view, from believing that they are neglected, underappreciated, and purposeless, to a view that the world is open to them, that they are powerful in spirit, emotion and mind and that a new or additional purpose is just a heartbeat away. I do this by helping them connect with their heart on a spiritual emotional and physical level. 

Every person has a purpose of their life, whether they know what it is or not, and their happiness comes from any small step they make toward that purpose. The questions about your purpose can't be answered with your logical mind, but you can feel the answers rising out of the depth of your subconscious mind, especially that part of the subconscious called the heart.

About Me:

