Cynthia,Sampson,Chief Executive Officer,Life Adjustment Team,Executive Director / CEO at Life Adjustment Team,"Life Adjustment Team (LAT) is a behavioral health organization with 50 years of experience delivering high-quality, community-based mental health services across Los Angeles County.LAT provides a comprehensive continuum of care, including Intensive Outpatient (IOP), Partial Hospitalization (PHP), and Psychosocial Rehabilitation (PSR) for adults with complex mental health needs. Our programs are grounded in evidence-based practices and emphasize measurable outcomes, functional improvement, and continuity of care—supporting safe and effective transitions from higher levels of treatment to sustained community stability.What distinguishes LAT is our strong clinical leadership and long-standing expertise in treating individuals who require more than traditional outpatient care. We frequently serve patients stepping down from inpatient or residential settings, as well as individuals with serious mental illness, co-occurring conditions, and neurodivergent or IDD-related challenges.We partner closely with hospitals, physicians, and payer organizations to reduce readmissions, improve engagement, and ensure timely access to clinically appropriate levels of care. My leadership approach prioritizes ethical growth, regulatory integrity, transparency, and clinical quality, ensuring that expansion and innovation are aligned with patient safety, provider accountability, and long-term system sustainability.",No,,,,,,United States,California,Marina Del Rey,c_suite,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/cynthiasampson,Life Adjustment Team,11-50,27,mental health care,,"The Life Adjustment Team provides effective in-home structure and support systems that empower patients to live stable, active and productive lives using evidence-based treatment concepts for successful rehabilitation and recovery.

