Freddy,"Sotelo, MD MPH FACEP","Co-Founder, QuantEM Care Assist",Norava Health,CEO and Co-Founder @ ContinuEM | Certified Physician Executive,"With over 16 years of experience as an Emergency Medicine Physician and more than 5 years as CEO and Co-Founder of ContinuEM, I am now leading Norava Health as Architect of What Comes Next to redefine how healthcare is practiced and delivered. My focus lies in leveraging advanced technology, patient-centered design, and innovative care models to address critical challenges in American healthcare.  As a Certified Physician Executive and Board-Certified Emergency Medicine Physician, I am committed to driving meaningful change in healthcare. My career centers on improving patient outcomes, reducing clinician burdens, and creating innovative solutions that enhance care delivery and accessibility.",Yes,,,,,,United States,California,Long Beach,founder,"c_suite, medical_health",https://www.linkedin.com/in/freddy-sotelo-md-mph-facep-89a018188,ContinuEM,51-200,22,hospitals and health care,,"ContinuEM Healthcare is a physician-founded platform uniting AI-powered clinical decision support, ER-grade care, advanced imaging, CLIA-certified lab services, and direct primary care into one seamless experience for patients and clinicians. Our mission is to fix the cost and access crisis in healthcare by bringing hospital-level capabilities into an outpatient, membership-friendly model that delivers faster, more affordable, and more personalized care.

ContinuEM Urgent Care is our high-acuity urgent care and imaging hub, designed and staffed by emergency physicians to manage up to 85% of traditional ER case types in a modern outpatient setting. With on-site CT, MRI, ultrasound, procedures, infusions, and a CLIA-certified lab, ContinuEM routinely delivers 30-minute average wait times and patient satisfaction in the 90+ NPS range, while significantly reducing unnecessary ER utilization and per-patient costs.
