Aaron,Grossman,Chairman/CEO,Praos Health,RECRUITMENT EXECUTIVE & ENTREPRENEUR,"ENTREPRENEUR

Having experienced success both on an individual basis and in management, Aaron Grossman decided to start Alliance Solutions Group in 2001. Along with his partner, Kevin Kramer, the two teamed up to create an organization that has grown substantially since its inception. Both partners attribute this success to hard work, strong ethics, and the overwhelming desire to meet and exceed their customers expectations. In 2015, Ernst & Young awarded Aaron Grossman as the winner of the Entrepreneur of the Year award for the Services category.  The foundation of Alliance Solutions Group is based on the specialized staffing model. Over the years, Aaron Grossman has developed unique practice areas that specialize in highly focused industry segments. These business units are comprised of teams that help talented professionals in that niche find suitable employment that matches their skill sets and experience.

THE TALENTLAUNCH NETWORK

On July 4, 2016,  Aaron Grossman launched Talentlaunch, a network of independently operated staffing and recruitment firms located throughout the United States. Talentlaunch was established to help solve a problem that is prevalent throughout the staffing industry. There are over 20,000 staffing firms in the United States, with 97% of all staffing firms having less than $25 million in annual revenues. 82% of the 20,000 staffing firms have less than $5 million in annual revenues. While this fragmentation in the industry could suggest that local communities enjoy working with local community based staffing firms, the average Net Promoter Score which gauges the customer experience is an abysmal 4 out of a possible 100. Many small and mid sized staffing firms do not have the tools and resources available to them to drive a better experience. By design, Talentlaunch infuses big company resources and tools into the member companies that operate within the network to help them reach new heights.",Yes,,,,,,United States,Ohio,Independence,c_suite,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/aaronsgrossman,Praos Health,11-50,16,hospitals and health care,,"Healthcare Staffing Reimagined®

