Per,Hellsund,President & CEO,Cybrexa Therapeutics,Chief Executive Officer at Cybrexa Therapeutics,"I am an experienced and innovative business leader with a passion for building great teams and great companies. 

At CyVek, in 4 1/2 years we developed a novel protein analysis platform from scratch and successfully sold the company to Bio-Techne for $105M. Prior to CyVek I built a successful company that develops, manufacturers, and markets industrial ink jet printing systems. I have a proven track record of success through flawless execution of business strategy, bringing disruptive technologies to market and building high performance leadership teams for two emerging start-up businesses.
 
From 2008 to 2014 Per Hellsund was the Founder and CEO of CyVek Inc., which developed a novel platform technology to enable translational research in life sciences, biotechnology and healthcare sectors. The CyVek technology was designed for easy implementation into clinical diagnostic settings, and is based on a novel microfluidic test (assay) cartridge that provides high data quality (sensitivity, specificity, variability) coupled with the efficiency and cost benefits of a multiplexed system, while at the same time significantly improving ease of use over current systems. 

