Usman,Ezad,Chief Executive Officer,Health & Psychiatry,"Visionary Chairman & CEO of Health and Group | Pioneer in Telepsychiatry, Founder of Health & Psychiatry | Recognized by U.S. Presidents & Dubai Health Authority | Building the World’s First Psychiatry Franchise Model","Visionary CEO and Founder of Health & Psychiatry, where innovation meets compassion in redefining mental health care.
A pioneer of telepsychiatry long before it was mainstream, recognized by U.S. Presidents and the Dubai Health Authority for transforming how care is delivered.
Driven by bold ideas, grounded in empathy  building the world’s first psychiatry franchise model to make healing accessible worldwide

Usman Ezad is a visionary entrepreneur, healthcare innovator, and Founder & CEO of Health & Psychiatry  one of America’s most forward-thinking mental health organizations.
His story began far from Clearwater, Florida  in Rawalpindi, Pakistan  where resilience and ambition shaped his path. Trained as a mechanical engineer at UET Lahore, Usman moved to the U.S. in 2000 and went on to earn dual MBAs in Marketing and Human Resources, graduating with honors. His thesis on eBay Motors earned him an invitation to present at eBay’s California headquarters  an early sign of his analytical and entrepreneurial mindset.
After record-breaking success at Honda and Mercedes-Benz, where he launched high-impact business development programs, Usman pivoted to healthcare  inspired by his wife, Dr. Dinar Sajan, a psychiatrist trained at Northwestern Memorial Hospital. Together, they founded Health & Psychiatry in 2009, starting with a one-room office and a bold belief: that access to quality mental health care should transcend walls, stigma, and geography.
Years before telehealth became mainstream, Usman built custom telepsychiatry carts (2011), laying the foundation for what would become Florida’s first full telepsychiatry office (2016). During COVID-19, when the world shut down, Health & Psychiatry became a national model  launching the first drive-in telepsychiatry clinic in the U.S. Their forward-thinking approach allowed thousands to continue receiving care when it was needed most.
Today, Health & Psychiatry has evolved into a multimillion-dollar enterprise with multiple locations, pioneering treatments like TMS and Spravato for treatment-resistant depression. Under Usman’s leadership, the practice has earned numerous honors  from the Global Recognition Award (2025) to acknowledgment by U.S. Presidents and the Dubai Health Authority for healthcare innovation.
Now, Usman and Dr. Sajan are building the world’s first psychiatry franchise model, designed to make mental health care more affordable, accessible, and compassionate across the globe.",No,,,,,,United States,Florida,Oldsmar,founder,"c_suite, medical_health",https://www.linkedin.com/in/usmanezad,Health & Psychiatry,51-200,25,mental health care,,"About Health & Psychiatry

At Health & Psychiatry, we’re redefining mental health care across Florida with compassion, innovation, and hope. Led by Chief Medical Officer Dinar Sajan, MD, our mission is to help every patient find health, harmony, and healing through personalized behavioral health services.

With clinics located throughout Florida and telepsychiatry available from anywhere, we make quality mental health care more accessible than ever. Our team specializes in treating ADHD, anxiety, depression, bipolar disorder, OCD, PTSD, and substance use disorders, offering both comprehensive medication management and advanced TMS therapy for medication-resistant depression.

We believe mental wellness is more than a diagnosis it’s a journey. That’s why we provide same day appointments, extended hours, and emergency visits, ensuring every patient receives the care they need, when they need it most.

At Health & Psychiatry, we live by the words of Vivian Greene:
“Life isn’t about waiting for the storm to pass, it’s learning to dance in the rain.”

For hope, health and harmony, we’re here for you.

Learn more about our services and vision at https://healthandpsychiatry.com/.

Join us in our mission to help patients live fulfilling lives, no matter the challenges they face.",https://healthandpsychiatry.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/health-psychiatry,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,1000000-5000000,,,healthandpsychiatry.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
