gina,de la Chesnaye,Teaching and Meditation Faculty,Nalanda Institute for Contemplative Science,"Founder and Director, The Nachan Project  | Mental Health, Human Rights","I work at the intersection of humanitarian practice, global mental health, and women’s rights. For 10+ years across the U.S. and East Africa, I’ve designed and led trauma-informed community programs, trained frontline staff, and delivered support initiatives for trauma survivors in high-stress and resource-restricted environments.

