alinhunter,NAMI North Carolina,11-50,31,mental health care,,"NAMI (National Alliance on Mental Illness) North Carolina is a nonprofit organization, governed by a volunteer board of directors. It's mission is to provide support, education, advocacy and public awareness so that all affected by mental illness can build better lives. 

