- create and ensure that consistent, repeatable, and reliable processes are in place for product manufacturability;
- prove that the process is achieving performance and yielding expectations;
- and ensure production scale up with relentless management of the supply chain and fulfillment process.

From project management to supply chain management to QS management, at Prospect, we pay attention to details, and focus on manufacturing new medical devices with safety, cost efficiency, and scalability in mind.",http://prospectlifesciences.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/prospect-life-sciences,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,500000-1000000,,,prospectlifesciences.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
