Dr. Mauricio,Garcia Jacques,Chief Executive Officer,Raport,"Founder at RAPORT, ACHE Medical Group, RegenACHE","Physician, founder, and healthcare operator with training across academic medicine, public health, and healthcare management. I’ve built and scaled a multi-site medical practice while also founding health technology companies focused on solving real operational pain points.

