Patricia,"Olinger, JM",Chief Relationship Officer,Varro,"Chief Relationship Officer @ Varro, Inc  | CEO BEAMS LLC Consulting | Biosecurity, Biorisk Management, Organizational Leadership, Strategic Leadership","Patty Olinger is a globally recognized leader in biorisk management, infection prevention, and public health preparedness. With over 25 years of experience, she has guided organizations through biological risk, crisis response, and health resilience across sectors and borders.

