Cynthia,Sierra,Chief Executive Officer,"Manet Community Health Center, Inc.","Chief Executive Officer, Manet Community Health Center","Cynthia Sierra brings a wealth of experience in health care, mental health, neuropsychology and social services administration to her role as Chief Executive Officer at Manet Community Health Center. She assumed this position in January of 2016 after serving as Acting CEO since July 2015.

