Calum,Handley,Co-Founder & Chief Product and Marketing Officer,We The Village,Helping Families & Training Professionals To Overcome Addiction - We The Village,"‘Experience is the greatest teacher’ and ‘structured flexibility’ are two life principles that I’ve grown with and continue to live by.

From my start as a founding member of The Hyperfactory in the early 2000’s (acq. by Meredith Corporation 2010, subsequently acquired by Accenture 2018) where for 10+ years we pioneered the mobile channel for some of the world's favorite brands, to tackling the challenges of asset location with my failed venture and crowd-funded startup Magpie (top 1% Kickstarter by backers numbers & funds raised), to shaping the new face of pet healthcare with Human Ventures studio-born company Milo.

