Janet,"Guptill, FACHE, CPHIMS",President & CEO,Scottsdale Institute,President & CEO | Driving Healthcare Innovation | Championing Executive Collaboration,"As CEO of the Scottsdale Institute, I'm energized by the opportunity to serve a community of over 60 member health systems, all committed to transforming healthcare through information technology. Our mission at SI is rooted in the belief that by equipping senior leaders with strong connections, essential knowledge, and strategic insights, we can collectively navigate the complexities of digital change with confidence.
 
