My journey through the healthcare leadership landscape has offered me a unique perspective and a broad network that connects CEOs, CIOs, and clinical and operational leaders across many of the nation's leading health systems. This network is the foundation of the Scottsdale Institute, where we strive to foster a deeper understanding of healthcare's complexity and to bridge conversations across disciplines and roles.
 
As we witness the accelerating impact of AI on new care models, we recognize the need for leadership to evolve in tandem. At SI, we connect today's leaders with those shaping the future. 
 
Our Contribution:
• Advancing digital transformation in a way that prioritizes equity and delivers measurable impact.
• Leveraging data and strategic foresight to support the industry as it pushes forward.
• Supporting the dedicated leaders working to build a better future for healthcare.
 
