Carlos,Perea,Chief Executive Officer,Terra Vera,Chief Executive Officer at Terra Vera | Seeking beekeepers | Building companies that are sustainable economically and environmentally | Active as a director and advisor to impact companies  | YPOer,"I am an entrepreneur focused on creating value by applying technology to solve major issues.  My current focus is Terra Vera where we are dedicated to making it easier for farmers to grow valuable crops without the use of the synthetic pesticides that are often linked to major environmental damage and health issues in our food.

