Dave,Johnson,Founder and CEO,Icarus Medical,Founder and CEO @ Icarus Medical. Joint unloading technology.,"""Helping Orthopedic & Sports Medicine Clinicians Improve Patient Outcomes & Satisfaction with Conservative Care – 98% Report Significant Pain & Function Improvements, Boosting Revenue Without Surgery or Injections""

I love bringing a team together to solve hard problems. As for Icarus, we are on a mission to apply advancements in digital 3D technology to improve the quality of life and elevate the standard of care for those suffering from joint pain/knee osteoarthritis. We are a technology integrator of all things 3D who is pushing the boundaries of science by inventing practical solutions.",No,,,,,,United States,Virginia,Charlottesville,founder,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/icarusdave,Icarus Medical,11-50,48,wellness and fitness services,,"At Icarus Medical Innovations, our mission is simple yet powerful: to improve lives by reducing pain and enhancing movement. We put the patient first, designing innovative orthopedic solutions that push the boundaries of 3D-printing, biomechanics, and design to create braces that provide real, lasting relief.

Our approach is driven by cutting-edge technology and a commitment to innovation, but at our core, we are a company built by real people with real experiences—starting with our founder, Dave Johnson.

Dave’s journey began at 15 years old, when a football injury led to a knee dislocation and early-onset arthritis decades ahead of the typical timeline. By his early 30s, facing bone-on-bone osteoarthritis, he was told his only real option was a knee replacement—a solution that came with risks, limitations, and long-term complications.

Determined to find another way, Dave had an idea: what if a brace could unload the knee the same way weight loss could reduce joint stress? With that, he built his first prototype in his garage—a knee brace with built-in springs to provide real-time relief. And it worked.

Seeing firsthand how this concept transformed his own mobility, Dave began refining the design, helping others with similar conditions, and ultimately launching Icarus Medical to bring true innovation to orthopedic bracing.

Today, Icarus Medical leads the industry with 3D-printed, patient-centric solutions that provide custom fit, superior comfort, and dynamic support. Our braces aren’t just medical devices—they are tools to help people reclaim their active lifestyles and live without limits.

With a foundation built on technology, patient experience, and relentless innovation, we are reshaping the future of orthopedic support—one brace at a time.

If you’re a clinician looking to enhance your bracing program or a patient wondering if Icarus products are right for you, we’d love to connect. Feel free to send us a message or email at info@icarusmedical.com.",http://www.icarusmedical.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/icarus-medical-innovations,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,1000000-5000000,600000,GRANT,icarusmedical.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
