Eric,"Rubinfeld, OD",Chief Executive Officer,Westchester Eyes,Founder & CEO @ Westchester Eyes | Healthcare Entrepreneur | MBA | 30+ Yrs Scaling Clinical & Retail Platforms across US & Asia | Strategic Partnerships,"I am a healthcare entrepreneur and clinician with more than three decades of experience building, operating, and scaling patient-centered eye care businesses.

The Road Less Traveled 
My career path has been unconventional, taking me from New York to Asia (Japan, Taiwan, S. Korea, Hong Kong, and China) and back to New York. In that time, I have founded and operated many startups in medical, retail, and manufacturing across both the U.S. and China, gaining first-hand experience in building, restructuring, and growing businesses.

The Strategy Behind the Science
To complement my clinical background and entrepreneurial interests, I earned my MBA from the University of Hong Kong. This education equipped me with a deep understanding of strategy, operations, branding, and scalable business systems.

Current Focus
Today, I am the founder and CEO of Westchester Eyes, a multi-location platform in the New York Metro area where we integrate advanced eye care and MedSpa services with a focus on clinical innovation, operational discipline, and patient experience.

My background spans clinical care, corporate strategy, retail, manufacturing, and restructuring. I’ve led initiatives across product development, branding, and operational transformation in both early-stage and mature businesses.

Collaborations & Partnerships 
I have a particular interest in studying strategic partnerships across unconventional business relationships that intersect healthcare, retail, aesthetics, and consumer experience.

