Mitesh,"Rao, MD",Founder & CEO,OMNY Health,Founder & CEO @ OMNY,"Dr. Mitesh B. Rao, MD, MHS, is a distinguished physician, entrepreneur, and leader at the intersection of healthcare, technology, and patient safety. He is the Founder and Chief Executive Officer of OMNY Health, a venture-backed company dedicated to revolutionizing how healthcare data is shared and valued. Under Dr. Rao's leadership, OMNY Health has built a national data network to meet the growing demand for real-world data at scale. The platform encompasses over 100 million lives and features a comprehensive universe of continuous, structured, and unstructured data sourced directly from large Integrated Delivery Networks (IDNs), Specialty Networks, National Cancer Institute (NCI) centers, Children's Hospitals, and Academic Medical Centers (AMCs). This dynamic network, covering over 650,000 clinicians across all 50 states, serves as a foundational ecosystem where data acts as a common language to accelerate medical innovation.

