Cindy,Aplanalp-Ruzicka,Co-Founder,Löyly Sauna Lounge,"TEDx Speaker in Training - “The Sh*t Show” | Founder, Löyly Sauna Lounge & Chairma Design Group | Award-Winning Designer | In-Home Wellness Expert | Cold Water Courage Movement","I’m in the middle of a miracle - and I’m finally telling the truth about it.
For years, I looked like I had it all together: award-winning interior designer, thriving business, wine in hand.  Behind the scenes? I was unraveling - physically, emotionally, spiritually.
One humiliating moment in an airport line cracked me open, beginning what I now call “The Sh*t Show” -my five-year descent through shame, fecal incontinence, and total loss of control. I thought my life was over.
It wasn’t. It was being reborn.
Healing came not from medicine, but from cold water, breathwork, and radical self-acceptance.
That journey led to the creation of Löyly Sauna Lounge in Houston - a social wellness sanctuary where science meets soul.
It also awakened a new dimension of boldness I call Cold Water Courage - the moment you stop numbing and start feeling. That pivot changed everything. It became my purpose.
And I want every woman to know what I know.
Now, through my upcoming TEDx talk and keynote, The Sh*t Show,* I speak to the power of facing discomfort instead of avoiding it - and how courage, coherence, and community can turn breakdown into breakthrough.
In parallel, I continue my decades-long design career, helping homeowners and builders integrate wellness into the spaces where they live. I’ll be a featured in-home wellness expert on a 2026 KBIS/IBS industry panel, sharing how contrast therapy, breathwork, and biophilic design are shaping the next frontier of human-centered spaces.
I’m not anti-wine. I’m pro-awake.
And I’m here to help others step out of their own “sh*t show” and into wholeness.
Let’s connect if you’re curious about:
🌊 TEDx, keynote, or podcast collaborations
🌊 Alcohol-free and sober-curious living
🌊 Resilience, menopause, and nervous-system healing
🌊 In-home wellness design and sensory environments
🌊 The science and soul of contrast therapy

🧊 “The truth of who you are shows up in cold water.”",No,,,,,,United States,Texas,Houston,founder,design,https://www.linkedin.com/in/cindy-aplanalp-ruzicka,Löyly Sauna Lounge,11-50,8,wellness and fitness services,,"Welcome to Löyly Sauna Lounge, Houston's premier wellness destination specializing in contrast therapy. Located in the heart of Montrose, our lounge offers a transformative approach to health and recovery through the powerful combination of sauna, cold plunge, and hot plunge sessions.

Founded by Dion and Cindy Ruzicka, Löyly Sauna Lounge was born from a deeply personal journey. When faced with Dion's leukemia diagnosis, they turned to daily contrast therapy as a natural alternative to invasive treatments. Through this practice, Dion regained his health, and both he and Cindy experienced a life-changing transformation. Their journey ignited a passion to share these benefits with others, leading to the creation of a wellness community unlike any other in Houston.

At Löyly, we prioritize community over solitude. Instead of private suites, our communal space fosters connection and support, guided by an expert-trained team. Our approach is rooted in the science-backed protocols of contrast therapy expert Dr. Susanna Søberg, ensuring maximum benefits for both body and mind.

