Courtney,Carlsson,Co-Founder & CEO,Kin Therapy,Co-Founder & CEO Kin Therapy | Venture Partner | UK Channel swimmer,"I first saw a mental health counsellor when I was 10. It didn’t help — I left more confused and misunderstood than when I walked in. That experience sent me on a 20+ year search across psychotherapy, neuroscience, behavioural change, and digital therapeutics for what actually creates lasting change.When I finally found support that genuinely worked, I got obsessed with one question: how do we make effective mental health care more engaging, scalable, and human?Today I’m building Kin Therapy — an AI-native, family-inclusive intensive outpatient program reimagining mental health care for young people and their families. Most programs treat the teen for a few hours and send them home to the same system that helped produce the crisis. Kin builds care around the whole family, makes it insurance-reimbursed, and measures every patient’s progress. The early signal from our first cohort points one direction: when you build care around the family, people show up and they get better.This isn’t my first rodeo. I previously founded Paradym, an evidence-based wellbeing platform bridging self-help and therapy. With a team spanning Harvard Medical School and Oxford, we showed significant improvements in anxiety, depression, and wellbeing across 100K+ users in 150+ countries — featured in the Journal of Medical Internet Research and featured in Women's Health, Apple Editorial, Vogue, The Telegraph, and Dazed.Earlier I worked across startups and global companies — LinkedIn, LVMH, and Soma Analytics (acquired by Prenetics Health). MBA, London Business School; BA in Political Economy &amp; Philosophy, Georgetown.I’m half Swedish, half Filipina, born in Chicago and raised in London, and I speak French, Swedish, Italian, Mandarin, and some Tagalog. I care most about building mental health care that’s preventative, personalised, measurable, and human — starting with the next generation.",Yes,,,,,,United States,New York,New York,founder,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/courtneycarlsson,Kin Therapy,2-10,7,mental health care,,Virtual intensive mental health programs for teens - accessible from anywhere.,https://www.kin-therapy.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/kintherapy,PRIVATELY_HELD,0,100000-500000,,,www.kin-therapy.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
