Wendy,"Airoso, MAOM, CT(ASCP)",Brain Trainer,Mending Trauma LLC,"Cytologist, Brain Trainer, & Cofounder of Mending Trauma: offering trauma-informed workplace training, neurofeedback, & trauma recovery programs","I am a recovered perfectionist/overachiever. I did not want to behave that way, but those were residual symptoms of my traumatic life experiences. Overworking distracted me from dealing with what was really going on in my body and mind.

