Scott,E.,"Co-owner, CEO, Board Member",Radix BioSolutions: Large Scale Antibody Labeling Services | Assay Development | Validation,CEO at Radix BioSolutions,"I am a seasoned CEO, Board Director, and strategic advisor with more than 40 years of executive leadership across biotechnology, CRO services, life-science tools, and enterprise software. I specialize in guiding scientifically-led organizations through growth, operational transformation, and strategic liquidity events.

As CEO and Chairman of Radix BioSolutions, I am leading the company's evolution as a custom scientific services shop into a scalable CRO and reagent labeling business with strong recurring revenues, high margins, and operational discipline. Working closing with scientific owners and founders, I have repositioned the company toward more focused assay development, immunoassay innovation, and high-value conjugation workflows - strengthening Radix's presence across pharma research and animal health.

