Florence,Comite,Founder & CEO,Groq Health,CEO & Founder at Comite Center for Precision Medicine & Healthy Longevity  CEO & Founder at Groq Health,"Florence Comite MD is the nation’s leading endocrinologist in the field of Precision Medicine and Healthy Longevity. She is regarded as the original Nof1™ longevity physician, having pioneered breakthrough personalized interventions to reverse biological aging and its disorders over the past 30 years. 

Dr. Comite began her medical journey at Yale University School of Medicine and continued at Yale with a residency in Internal Medicine. She completed a fellowship in reproductive endocrinology (multidisciplinary training incorporating pediatrics, gynecology, and andrology) at the National Institute of Child Health and Human Development at the National Institutes of Health. Dr. Comite remained at the NIH as a senior clinical research associate before joining the Yale faculty as an associate professor in three departments—Reproductive Endocrinology in Gynecology, Internal Medicine, and Pediatrics. During her 25-year faculty tenure, Dr. Comite founded and directed Women’s Health at Yale, the nation’s first female-focused health clinic. 
 
In 2005, she launched her bespoke medical practice, Comite Center for Precision Medicine & Healthy Longevity, in New York City and, subsequently, expanded offices to Palo Alto and Miami Beach.  

Dr. Comite has published in such peer-reviewed journals as New England Journal of Medicine, JAMA, and Journal of Endocrinology and Metabolism, among others. She is widely sought after as an expert for print and broadcast media and as a consultant for men’s health, women’s health, digital health, start-up companies, and related businesses. Dr. Comite has served on advisory councils and committees in connection with the NIH, the Egyptian Ministry of Health, the International Spa Association, Age Management Medicine, and the Institute of Medicine. 
 
Her work has been featured on CNBC, The New York Times, The Wall Street Journal, and Newsweek, among others. Dr. Comite is the author of the Amazon best-seller Keep It Up: The Power of Precision Medicine to Conquer Low T and Revitalize Your Life (Rodale 2013) and is currently busy with another book project.  
 
