Neil,Hobbs,General Counsel,TigerConnect,General Counsel at TigerConnect,"U.S. and U.K. qualified lawyer with over twenty years’ post-qualification experience in a broad range of commercial, corporate, and international legal areas. Particular areas of specialization include commercial contracts, litigation, patents, contract dispute management, real estate, general compliance and corporate matters.",No,,,,,,United States,California,Los Angeles Metropolitan Area,c_suite,master_legal,https://www.linkedin.com/in/nshobbs,TigerConnect,201-500,345,hospitals and health care,,"Healthcare communication has become fragmented across systems, devices, and departments, forcing clinicians to act as the “middleware” that manually routes information when technology cannot. This creates delays, coordination gaps, and added cognitive load at the exact moments when speed and clarity matter most.

