Melanie,"Stover  OT, MBA, MS ISM",Owner of Home Care Sales,Home Care Sales,"Helping home health, hospice & home care agencies activate 6 new referral partners in 6 months | Founder, Home Care Sales | OT turned sales strategist | Creator of Dx Sell™","Your marketer is making visits. They're showing up. They're dropping off brochures.  And referrals are flat.  The problem is not effort. It's language.  Most home care sales reps talk about their agency. What services they offer. How long they've been in business. How great their caregivers are.  Referral sources don't care.  Physicians, discharge planners, and case managers care about one thing: Can you solve the clinical problem sitting in front of them right now? That's why I built Dx Sell™. It's the only diagnosis-based selling methodology in home health, hospice, and home care. It teaches your reps to speak the clinical language of the referral sources they're sitting across from. Not sales language. Clinical language.  I'm an Occupational Therapist who worked for VNA. I've spent 25 years inside the agencies, on the sales calls, in the discharge planning offices. I know what referral sources need to hear because I used to be one.  In 2001, I started Home Care Sales from my dining room in Tennessee. Today, we're the only OT-led sales training firm in the industry. I've coached thousands of agencies from single-location operators to national franchise networks.  The flagship program is 6-in-6: Activate 6 new referral partners in 6 months. It gives your team the system, the language, the coaching, and the accountability to generate referrals that actually convert to admissions.  Results from real clients: → $30K+ revenue increase in 8 weeks → +600 hours by end of first engagement → Agencies that double and triple revenue with raving referral sources, year after year  If you own a home health, hospice, or home care agency and your marketers are busy but your census is stuck, we should talk.  → See how 6-in-6 works: homecaresales.com/growth → Custom training or consulting: → Call direct: 888-451-1747  Your mission is BIGGER than their ""No.""™",Yes,,,,,,United States,Alabama,Mobile Metropolitan Area,founder,"master_sales, medical_health",https://www.linkedin.com/in/melaniestoverot,Home Care Sales,2-10,7,hospitals and health care,,"Home Care Sales is a Home Health, Hospice, and Private Duty specific sales consulting firm.",http://www.homecaresales.com,https://www.linkedin.com/company/homecaresales,PUBLIC_COMPANY,0,100000-500000,,,homecaresales.com,,,Healthcare founders/owners netnew
