Jeffrey,"Hausfeld, M.D., M.B.A.",Chairman of the Board and Chief Medical Officer,"BioFactura, Inc.","Chairman of the Board and Chief Medical Officer at BioFactura, Inc.","Jeffrey N. Hausfeld M.D., M.B.A., F.A.C.S.
Chairman of the Board of Directors and Chief Medical Officer– BioFactura Inc./Capitol Biologics
