But my work isn’t only professional, it’s personal.

My life journey has included overcoming homelessness, addiction, severe injuries, cancer, and multiple health setbacks. Those experiences ultimately became the foundation for a philosophy I now share through my keynote program The Box of Life, where I speak to audiences about resilience, personal responsibility, and transforming adversity into purpose.

