Dr Siddhant,Bhargava,Co-founder and CEO,DUSQ,Building DUSQ | Ex-Food Darzee | Forbes 30u30 Asia’22,"I'm the founder that actually sleeps wellI got Lupus at 22. Got obsessed with nutrition. Finished med-school. Built a food company instead of feeling sorry for myself. Food Darzee grew into India's largest goal-oriented nutrition company. Bootstrapped, 2.5 million meals delivered, $25M in lifetime revenue. Before I was 25.Then cancer. And I realized food alone wasn't enough. I went deeper. Non-invasive glucose monitoring, electronic socks for diabetic foot ulcers, electronic diapers for stress urinary incontinence, neural wearables for stress. Unglamorous problems nobody wanted to touch. I touched them anyway.Every failure pointed to the same root cause: SLEEP. Not as a wellness trend. As the single system governing recovery, immunity, cognition, and resilience and the one modern life has quietly destroyed. That became DUSQ. The world's first active sleep regulation wearable. Not a tracker. Not a score. A system that actually intervenes . We started in India. We're heading to the US. And we're just getting started. If you're building in health-tech, firmware, hardware, bio-signal algorithms, or consumer growth and you want to work on something that genuinely matters, hit me up !",Yes,,,,,,United States,California,San Francisco,founder,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/dr-siddhant-bhargava,DUSQ,11-50,24,wellness and fitness services,,"DUSQ (formerly InnerGize) is the world’s first sleep regulation system. 
