Milton,Dallas,CEO & Founder,Rx Destroyer - Drug Disposal System,CEO & Founder Rx Destroyer® - Drug Disposal Products,"Leader in acute, non-acute, and At-Home™ ready-to-use drug disposal since 2010
Rx Destroyer® motto is ""Saving Water Saving Lives...One Prescription at a Time""

What does that mean?
• Saving Water: When drugs are flushed, sinked or put into the landfill untreated, those drugs are entering our drinking water, rivers, and streams. These drugs are negatively affecting people, land animals, and aquatic life. 
• Saving Lives: Thru data, we know that 30% of prescribed drugs go unused within 30 days. Furthermore, data shows over 60% of teens begin their path of abuse and addiction by taking unused medication from their family’s medicine cabinets.

Storing and saving medications for future use is called “stockpiling”. Changing “stockpiling” behaviors is the first step in overcoming the opioid crisis. Just like clicking your seatbelt saves lives, disposing unused medications safely, daily, versus stockpiling WILL save lives.

Our teams will help you onboard, educate, and create a sustainable program in-person, vid conf or e-learning. 

Rx Destroyer® serves over 20 distinctly different customer types, partner with the top 10 medical distributors in the country and takes a great deal of pride on focusing efforts in Native American Indian and at-risk Communities. Being a Member of the Oneida Nation of Wisconsin, we are further guided by the 7 Generation Principle: “In our every deliberation, we must consider the impact of our decisions on the next seven generations.” Please consider joining us in saving lives, families, and your community. 

