* Biopharmaceutical thought leader, including multiple speaking and panelist engagements and publications",No,,,,,,United States,New York,New York,c_suite,c_suite,https://www.linkedin.com/in/nicolecmcknight,Buckle Therapeutics Inc.,2-10,5,biotechnology research,,"Our patented medical device delivers precision doses of drugs to the bloodstream via a swab applied to the buccal mucosa (inside of cheek and gums) with an onset of activity of under 5 minutes, comparable to injection and faster than swallowing.  Our bio-adhesive formulation overcomes the historical limitations of buccal delivery by protecting the drug substance from saliva and swallowing, as it is pushed directly across the mucosal surface into the bloodstream. This route of administration skips first pass metabolism in the liver and gut, reducing the risk of potentially toxic side effects.  Our novel combination of a proprietary applicator and formulation can transform the treatment of many health conditions, where urgent onset is required, oral delivery is inappropriate because of low bioavailability or GI side effects, and injection is impractical.

