Leonard,Ginsburg,Chairman,Moore Eye Institute,"Chairman, Moore Eye Institute and CEO,                                            Unified Dynamic Health Records","Dr. Leonard Ginsburg is Chairman of Moore Eye Institute, Founder and CMO of Dynamic Health Records/DHRpro, and Chairman of the Ophthalmology Residency Program at Philadelphia College of Osteopathic Medicine. For more than 20 years, he was one of the only retina specialists in the U.S. also to be a certified Diabetes Educator. Dr. Ginsburg founded Moore Eye Institute which has grown into one of the largest multispecialty institutions in the Philadelphia region. He is well known for his work and lectures in diabetic retinopathy, macular degeneration, and the links between religion and medicine.

